<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">RRK07.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ABARAMUZI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo ky'Abaramuzi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abaramuzi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bar</para>
  <para style="mt1">EKITABO ky'ABARAMUZI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s1">Abayuda n'Abasimeoni okusingura Abanyakanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 28:30">Kur 28:30</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kub 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 20:18">Bar 20:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'okufa kwa Yoshua, Abaisraeli bakabuuza MUKAMA nibagira bati: N'oha omuriitwe oribanza kwinamuka kuteera Abanyakanaani n'okubarwanisa? <verse eid="JDG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: Abayuda nibo barizayo; reeba mpaireyo ensi omu mikono yaabo. <verse eid="JDG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Abayuda baagira Abasimeoni beene waabo bati: Mwije tuhurure hamwe omu nsi ei twabagaine, turwanise Abanyakanaani; naitwe turyahurura naimwe omu nsi ei mwabagaine. Batyo Abasimeoni baahurura nabo. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:2">Zab 44:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abayuda bainamuka, MUKAMA yaahayo Abanyakanaani n'Abaperizi omu mikono yaabo; baabaitamu abantu kakumi omuri Bezeki. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Baashangayo Adoni-bezeki, baamurwanisa, baabinga Abanyakanaani n'Abaperizi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Adoni-bezeki yaahunga, baamukurata, baamukwata, baamucwaho ebikumu bishaija eby'engaro n'eby'ebigyere. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:19">Lev 24:19</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:13">Yak 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Adoni-bezeki yaagira ati: Abagabe makumi mushanju abacwirweho ebikumu bishaija by'engaro n'eby'ebigyere bakaba batorotoora obucwagurika bw'eby'okurya ahansi y'emeeza yangye; oku naabagizire, nikwo Ruhanga yangira. Baamutwara Yerusaalemu, yaagwayo.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kalebu okukubuura ensi ei yaahairwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Kandi Abayuda baateera Yerusaalemu, baagikwata, baagicwekyereza na rurara, n'orurembo baarutwekamu omuriro. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Bwanyima Abayuda baashuuma; baateera Abanyakanaani abaabaire batwire omu bibungo, n'omuri Negebu kandi n'omu mpanga. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Kandi baagaruka baateera Abanyakanaani abaabaire batwire Heburooni (eyaabaire neeyetwa Kiryasi-araba); baasingura Sheshai, Ahimaanu na Talumai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Ku baarugireyo, baateera abaabaire batwire Debira eyaabaire neeyetwa Kiryasi-seferi. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Obwo Kalebu yaagira ati: Oriteera Kiryasi-seferi, akagikwata, ndyamuhingira muhara wangye Akisa. <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:9">Bar 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Otinyeli, mutabani wa Kenazi, murumuna wa Kalebu, yaagikwata, onu yaamuhingira muhara we Akisa. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:18">Yos 15:18</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 15:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaahikire owa iba, yaamweshengyereza kushaba ishe ekibanja; yaaruga aha ndogoya ye; Kalebu yaamubuuza ati: Nooyenda ki? <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Nk'oku ontaire omu nsi ya Negebu, na mbwenu ongirire embabazi, ompe n'enshuro z'amaizi. Kalebu nikwo kumuha enshuro z'orubaju rwa ruguru n'orwa ifo.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okugumizamu kukubuura ensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 10:29-32">Kub 10:29-32</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 24:21">24:21</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 24:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:11">Bar 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:6">1 Sam 15:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima baijukuru b'Omukeeni ishezaara wa Musa baaruga omu rurembo rw'emikindo, bainamuka n'Abayuda, baaza omu ihamba rya Buyudaaya eriri omuri Negebu haihi na Araba, baatuura n'abantu baayo. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Abayuda baagyenda n'Abasimeoni beene waabo, baateera Abanyakanaani abaabaire batwire Zefasi, baagicwekyerereza kimwe. Bwanyima orwo rurembo rwayetwa Horuma. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Kandi Abayuda baagaruka baakubuura Gaaza n'ebyanga byayo, Ashikelooni n'ebyanga byayo na Ekurooni n'ebyanga byayo. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 17:16">Yos 17:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA yaaguma n'Abayuda, baakubuura ensi y'ebibungo; kwonka tibaabaasa kubinga abaabaire batwire omu mpita, ahabw'okuba bakaba baine ebigaari by'ebyoma. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:9">Yos 14:9</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 14:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Kalebu yaaheebwa Heburooni, nk'oku Musa yaagambire, yaabingamu beene Anaki bonshatu. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:63">Yos 15:63</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Ababenyamiini tibarabingire Abayebusi abaabaire batwire Yerusaalemu; kureka Abayebusi bakaguma batwire n'Ababenyamiini omuri Yerusaalemu n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="JDG 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Ab'omuryango gwa Yosefu nabo bainamuka, baateera Beseeli, MUKAMA yaaguma nabo. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:19">Kut 28:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ab'omuryango gwa Yosefu baatuma ab'okutata Beseeli; (orwo rurembo ira rukaba rwetwa Luuzi;) <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:15">1 Sam 30:15</ref>. </char></note> ezo ntatsi zaareeba omuntu naaruga omuri orwo rurembo, zaamugira ziti: Nitukweshengyereza, tworekye omuhanda ogurikuza omu rurembo; naitwe nitwija kukukorera eby'embabazi. <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Nawe yaabooreka omuhanda gurikuza omu rurembo, baarucwekyereza na rurara; kwonka ogwo mushaija baamureka n'ab'omu ka ye boona. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Omushaija ogwo yaagyenda, yaataaha omu nsi y'Abahiiti, yaayombeka orurembo, yaarweta Luuzi; eryo niryo iziina ryarwo n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />N'Abamanaase tibarabingire batuuzi b'omuri Besi-sheani na tauni zaayo, nari aba Tanaki na tauni zaayo, nari aba Doori na tauni zaayo, nari aba Ibuleamu na tauni zaayo, n'obu baakuba ab'omuri Megido na tauni zaayo; kureka Abanyakanaani bakaguma beetuuriire omuri egyo nsi. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Bwanyima Abaisraeli ku baaherize kugira amaani, baakoresa Abanyakanaani emirimo y'obuhuuku; tibaababingiramu kimwe.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />N'Abaefuraimu tibarabingire Banyakanaani abaabaire batwire Gezeri; kureka Abanyakanaani bakaguma batwire nabo omuri Gezeri.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />N'Abazebuluuni tibarabingire batuuzi b'omuri Kitirooni, n'obu baakuba ab'omuri Nahalooli; kureka Abanyakanaani bakaguma batwire nabo, nibabakorera emirimo y'obuhuuku.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />N'Abaasheri tibarabingire batuuzi b'omuri Ako, nari Sidoni, nari Ahulaabu, nari Akiziibu, nari Heliba, nari Afika, nari Rehobu; <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:34">Zab 106:34</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:35">35</ref>. </char></note> kureka Abaasheri bakatuura n'Abanyakanaani, abatuuzi b'omuri egyo nsi, ahakuba tibarababingiremu. <verse eid="JDG 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />N'Abanafutaali tibarabingire batuuzi b'omuri Beti-shemeshi, nari aba Besanaasi, kureka bakatuura n'abanyakanaani, abatuuzi b'omuri egyo nsi; kwonka abaabaire batwire Beti-shemeshi n'aba Besanaasi bakahinduka abairu b'okubakorera emirimo y'obuhuuku.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Abaamori bakabingira Abadaani omu bibungo, tibaabaikiriza kushuuma mu mpita; <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Abaamori abo baaguma beetuuriire aha kibungo Heresi, n'omuri Ayalooni n'omuri Shaalubiimu; kwonka ab'omuryango gwa Yosefu ku baabakirize amaani, baabagira abairu b'okubakorera emirimo y'obuhuuku. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Kandi emyatano y'Abaamori ekaba neetandikira aharikwinamuka Akarabiimu, neiha ahari Seela n'okwinamuka.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s1">Maraika wa MUKAMA okuhanira abantu Bokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Kut 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:8-11">Zab 105:8-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima maraika wa MUKAMA yaaruga Gilugaali, yaaza <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokimu amakuru ngu okurira. </char></note>Bokimu; yaagira ati: Nkabaiha Misri, naabareeta omu nsi ei naarahiire kuha baashwenkuriimwe, ningira nti: Tindiita ndagaano yangye ei naaragaine naimwe; <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />kandi naimwe mutariragaana endagaano n'abatwire omu nsi egi; kureka muryasheenya amatambiro gaabo. Kwonka timuroorobeire kiragiro kyangye. N'enki ekyabareeteire kukora mutyo? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:13">Yos 23:13</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 3:6">Bar 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:36">Zab 106:36</ref>. </char></note> Naanye nikyo ndikugirira nti, Tindibabinga mu maisho gaanyu; kureka baryaba nk'amahwa omu mbaju zaanyu, na baaruhanga baabo bababeere emitego. <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Maraika wa MUKAMA ku yaagambiire Abaisraeli boona ebigambo ebyo, abantu baimutsya amaraka gaabo, baarira. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Omwanya ogwo baagweta Bokimu; baatambirirayo MUKAMA ebitambo.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kw'ab'omu biro bya Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Yoshua ku yaaherize kwohereza abantu, Abaisraeli baagyenda, buri muntu yaaza omu nsi y'obuhunguzi bwe kugikubuura. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Abantu baaheereza MUKAMA omu biro byona ebya Yoshua, kandi n'omu biro byona eby'abakuru abaatsigaireho yaafiire, abaareebire ebikuru ebi MUKAMA yaakoreire Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Bwanyima Yoshua mutabani wa Nuuni, omugaragwa wa MUKAMA, yaafa, ahikize emyaka igana na ikumi. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Baamuziika omu kyanga ky'obuhunguzi bwe Timunaati-seera omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho bw'ekibungo kya Gaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 5:2">Kur 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:12">1 Sam 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 28:9">1 Bus 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:8">Gal 4:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ab'obusingye obwo boona nabo baafa baakurata baishenkurubo, baakuratwa ab'obusingye obundi abaabaire batarikumanya MUKAMA n'ebi yaakoreire Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okutaana na Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Abaisraeli baakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, baaheereza Baabaali; <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 10:6">Bar 10:6</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 10:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:11">Yer 2:11</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:13">13</ref>. </char></note> baimuura MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo, owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri; baakuratira baaruhanga abandi b'abanyamahanga abaabaire babeehinguririize, baabaramya, baagwisa kubi MUKAMA. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Baimuura MUKAMA, baaheereza Baabaali n'aba Ashitaroosi. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:8">Bar 3:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:58-62">Zab 78:58-62</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 50:1">Isa 50:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 7:12">Yos 7:12</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaabagirira ekiniga kingi, yaabahayo omu mikono y'abanyagi, baabanyaga; yaabarekurira abazigu baabo ababeehinguririize; tibaagaruka kugira garwanisa abazigu baabo. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:14-34">Lev 26:14-34</ref>. </char></note> Ei baabaire baza yoona, omukono gwa MUKAMA gubarwanisa ku bakora kubi, nk'oku MUKAMA yaabaire yaabateisize naarahira; baareeba enaku nyingi.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okubaha abaramuzi b'okubajuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 12:11">1 Sam 12:11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:20">Byak 13:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaimutsya abaramuzi abaatwire nibabajuna omu mikono y'abarikubanyaga. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Kwonka baayanga kworobera abaramuzi baabo; baakuratira baaruhanga abandi nk'abarikuraaya, baabaramya; baarahuka kuteishuka, baaruga omu mitwarize ya baishenkurubo, abaabaire boorobera ebiragiro bya MUKAMA; haza bo tibaatwaza batyo. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:44">Zab 106:44</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:7-10">Yer 18:7-10</ref>; <ref loc="JON 3:10">Yon 3:10</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA ku yaabaire abateeraho abaramuzi, aguma n'omuramuzi weena ou yaabateeraho, abajuna omu mikono y'abazigu baabo omu biro by'ogwo muramuzi byona; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ku yaabaire ahurira entsinda yaabo ahabw'abo abarikubahata nibabatuntuza, abagirira embabazi. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Kwonka ogwo muramuzi ku yaabaire afa, bagaruka enyima bakora kubi okukira baishenkurubo omu kukuratira baaruhanga abandi, okubaheereza n'okubaramya; kandi bakaba batareka bi barikukora, n'obu kwakuba okureka obugangaazi bwabo. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Ahabw'ebyo MUKAMA akaba agirira Abaisraeli ekiniga kingi, agira ati: Abantu aba baitsire endagaano yangye ei naaragaine na baishenkurubo nimbaragiira, kandi tibaahurira iraka ryangye, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />n'ahabw'ekyo naanye tindigaruka kubinga ihanga ryona omu maisho gaabo ahari ago agaatsigaireho obu Yoshua yaafa, <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:2">Bir 8:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:3">13:3</ref>. </char></note> mbone kurengyesa Abaisraeli amahanga ago, ndeebe ku baraabe nibaija kugyendera omu muhanda gwa MUKAMA, nk'oku baishenkurubo baabaire batwaza, nari shi batarikwija kutwaza batyo. <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Nikyo MUKAMA yaatsigiireho amahanga ago, atarahukye kugabinga; kandi atagaheyo omu mukono gwa Yoshua.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okweteerana n'amahanga agaatsigairemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:24">Yoh 2:24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:19">1 Kor 11:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aga nigo mahanga agu MUKAMA yaatsigireho kurengyesa Abaisraeli, nibo Baisraeli boona abaabaire batamanyiire ngamba zoona ez'omuri Kanaani, <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />ngu ab'obusingye bwona bw'Abaisraeli bamanyiire engamba, kandi okukira munonga ayegyese abo abaabaire batakarwanaga. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Abo nibo bakama bataano b'Abafilistia, n'Abanyakanaani boona, n'Abasidoni, n'Abahiivi, abaabaire batwire omu kibungo kya Lebanooni, okuruga aha rushozi rwa Baali-herumooni okuhika ah'orikutaahira nooza Hamasi. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Bakaba bari ab'okurengyesa Abaisraeli okumanya ku baraabe nibaija kworobera ebiragiro bya MUKAMA, ebi yaaragiire baishenkurubo naaraba omuri Musa. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />N'ahabw'ekyo Abaisraeli baatuura hamwe n'Abanyakanaani n'Abahiiti n'Abaamori n'Abaperizi n'Abahiivi n'Abayebusi; <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:3">Bir 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:12">Ezr 9:12</ref>. </char></note> baashwererana nabo, kandi baaheereza baaruhanga baabo.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otinyeli omuramuzi w'okubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:21">Bir 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:25">Bar 6:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli bakakora ebirikwanga MUKAMA, baayebwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, baaheereza Baabaali na Asheroosi. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Kyareetera MUKAMA kugirira Abaisraeli ekiniga ekirikwaka nk'omuriro, yaabahayo omu mikono ya Kushani-rishataimu, omugabe wa Mesopotamia; baamuheereza okumara emyaka munaana. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:10">1 Sam 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:27">Neh 9:27</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Abaisraeli ku baatakiire MUKAMA, yaabateeraho ow'okubajuna, niwe Otinyeli mwene Kenazi, murumuna wa Kalebu. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:6">1 Sam 10:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 11:6">11:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:13">16:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:1">2 Bus 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:34">Bar 6:34</ref>. </char></note> Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaamwijaho, yaaba omuramuzi w'Abaisraeli, yaarwana engamba, MUKAMA yaahayo Kushani-rishataimu omugabe wa Mesopotamia omu mikono ye, yaamusingura. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Okuruga obwo ensi yaahuumura engamba okumara emyaka makumi ana. Bwanyima Otinyeli mwene Kenazi yaafa.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehudi omuramuzi wa kabiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 16:12">Yer 16:12</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:4">Hos 6:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli baagaruka baakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA; MUKAMA yaaha Egulooni omugabe wa Moabu amaani g'okurwanisa Abaisraeli, ahabw'okuba bakaba bakozire ebirikwangwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Egulooni yaahuruza Abaamoni n'Abaamaleki, baateera Abaisraeli, baabasingura, baakubuura orurembo rwabo rw'emikindo. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Abaisraeli baamara emyaka ikumi na munaana, nibaheereza Egulooni omugabe wa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:15">Zab 50:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:12">Yer 29:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 29:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 20:16">Bar 20:16</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku baatakiire MUKAMA, yaabateeraho ow'okubajuna, niwe Ehudi mwene Geera Omubenyamiini, owaabaire naatwara emosho. Bwanyima Abaisraeli baamuha omutoijo gw'okutoijera Egulooni omugabe wa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehudi yaaheesesa rurara y'amoogi abiri, ey'oburaingwa bwa mukono gumwe; yaagyezirikira aha rukoba, neereereetera aha kibero kye kya buryo omunda y'ebijwaro bye. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Yaareetera Egulooni omugabe wa Moabu ogwo mutoijo; kandi Egulooni ogwo akaba ari omushaija muhango munonga. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ku yaaherize kuhayo ogwo mutoijo, yaayohereza abantu abagureetsire; <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />kwonka we ku yaahikire aha bishushani by'amabaare Gilugaali, yaatega, yaagaruka, yaagira omugabe ati: Nyakusinga, nyine eki ndikwenda kukugambira omu mubonano. Omugabe yaagira ati: Muhuname! Abagaragwa be boona baashohora, baaruga ahu yaabaire ari. <verse eid="JDG 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Ehudi yaija ahi ari, yaashanga ashutami wenka omu kishengye kye ky'amabeho eky'ahaiguru; yaamugira ati: Nkureeteire obutumwa oburikuruga ahari Ruhanga. Egulooni yaimuka omu kitebe kye. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ehudi yaatayo omukono gwe gwa bumosho, yaasyorayo rurara aha kibero kye kya buryo, yaagimutimbura aha nda, <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />n'ekirindi kyayo kyahwerayo; ebishanju byagishweka, ahakuba taragikwireyo; n'efa yaareetwaho. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Bwanyima Ehudi yaashohora; ku yaahikire omu kisasi, yaakinga enyigi z'ekyo kishengye ky'ahaiguru, yaazikingisa ekishumuruzo.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ehudi ku yaashohoire, abaheereza b'omugabe baija, baashanga enyigi z'ekyo kishengye zikingire; baateekateeka ngu agiire aha ishaazi omu kishengye ky'amabeho. <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Baategyereza okuhitsya obu baitsirwe enshoni; n'ahabw'ekyo baatwara ekishumuruzo, baaziigura, baashanga mukama waabo agangarami ahansi afiire. <verse eid="JDG 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Kwonka ku baabaire bakiri aheeru bategyereize, Ehudi yaacwa, yaaraba aha bishushani by'amabaare, yaahungira Seira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:3">1 Sam 13:3</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 7:24">Bar 7:24</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaahikireyo, yaateerera enzamba omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, Abaisraeli baashuuma nawe, nibaruga omuri ebyo bibungo, abeembeire. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:9">Bar 7:9</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 7:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:47">1 Sam 17:47</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 12:5">Bar 12:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Munkurate; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ahaireyo abazigu baanyu Abamoabu omu mikono yaanyu. Batyo baashuuma bamukuratiire, baakwata enyambukiro za Yorudani, ngu batangireho Abamoabu; kandi tibaikiriza muntu weena kwambuka. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Obwo baita omu Bamoabu abantu nka kakumi, abashaija boona ab'amaani kandi amamanzi; tihaahonokaho n'omwe. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Okwo nikwo Abamoabu baasingwirwe Abaisraeli ahari eryo izooba. Bwanyima ensi yaamara emyaka makumi munaana, ehumwire engamba.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Bwanyima yaakuratwa Shamugaari mwene Anaasi, owaitsire omu Bafilistia abashaija magana mukaaga n'omuhunda ogufunya ente; kandi nawe yaajuna Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s1">Debora na Baraki okuteera Sisera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Ehudi ku yaaherize kufa, Abaisraeli baagaruka, baakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA; <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:1">Yos 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:9">1 Sam 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:9">Zab 83:9</ref>. </char></note> kyareetera MUKAMA kubahayo omu mikono ya Yabini, omugabe wa Kanaani, owaabaire naategyekyera omuri Hazori; kandi omukuru w'eihe rye akaba ari Sisera, owaabaire atuura Harosheesi ey'Abanyamahanga. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:19">Bar 1:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:42">Zab 106:42</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baatakira MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba Yabini akaba aine ebigaari by'ebyoma magana mwenda, yaamara emyaka makumi abiri naita kubi Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:14">2 Bag 22:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:27">1 Kor 1:27</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo Debora nabikazi, muka Lapidoosi, niwe yaabaire naacwera Abaisraeli emanja. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Akaba ahimbisa kushutama ahansi y'omukindo gwa Debora ahagati ya Raama na Beseeli omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu; kandi Abaisraeli bakaba baija ah'ari kubashoboorora. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:32">Heb 11:32</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaatuma kweta Baraki mwene Abinoamu omuri Kedeshi-nafutaali, yaamugira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli tarakuragiire kugyenda kuteeranira abantu kakumi aha kibungo Tabora, noobaiha omu ruganda rwa Nafutaali n'orwa Zebuluuni? <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:20">Yos 11:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:11-14">Yoel 3:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:9">Zab 83:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ruhanga agizire ati: Naanye niinyija kukureetera Sisera omukuru w'eihe rya Yabini, akubugane aha mugyera Kishoni n'ebigaari bye n'engabo ze nyingi munonga, mmuheyo omu mikono yaawe. <verse eid="JDG 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Baraki yaamugarukamu ati: Ku oraagyende naanye, niinyija kugyenda; kwonka ku oraabe otagyenzire naanye, tindikwija kugyenda. <verse eid="JDG 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Yaamugira ati: N'ekya buzima niinyija kugyenda naiwe; kwonka orugyendo oru orikwija kugyenda tirurikwija kukuhaisa kitiinisa; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA naija kuhayo Sisera omu mikono y'omukazi. Debora yaimuka, yaagyenda na Baraki, baaza Kedeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:18">Bar 5:18</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikireyo, Baraki yaahuruza Abazebuluuni n'Abanafutaali kuteeranira Kedeshi; haija abantu kakumi bamukuratiire; na Debora yaagyenda nawe.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 1:16">Bar 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:1">Kur 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 18:1">18:1</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 10:29">Kub 10:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo Heberi Omukeeni akaba ataine n'Abakeeni, nibo baijukuru ba Hobabu ishezaara wa Musa; kandi ateire eihema rye ahansi y'omwela oguri omuri Zaananimu, haihi na Kedeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Ku baagambiire Sisera ku Baraki mwene Abinoamu yainamuka omu kibungo Tabora, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Sisera yaahuruza ebigaari bye byona, ebigaari by'ebyoma magana mwenda, n'engabo ze zoona ezaarugire Harosheesi ey'Abanyamahanga, yaabateeranira aha mugyera Kishoni. <verse eid="JDG 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:3">Bir 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:24">2 Sam 5:24</ref>. </char></note> Debora yaagambira Baraki ati: Imuka, ahakuba eri niryo izooba eri MUKAMA yaaheerayo Sisera omu mikono yaawe. Noogira ngu MUKAMA takwebembeire? Atyo Baraki yaaruga aha kibungo Tabora, yaashuuma n'engabo ze kakumi zimukuratiire. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:9">Zab 83:9</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 83:10">10</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaaburanzya Sisera n'ebigaari bye byona n'engabo ze zoona na rurara, baahunga omu maisho ga Baraki; na Sisera yaasyoka omu kigaari kye, yairuka, yaahunga. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Baraki yaagyenda abingire ebyo bigaari n'ezo ngabo, okuhika Harosheesi ey'Abanyamahanga; engabo zoona eza Sisera zaahwera ahari rurara, tihaagira waahonokaho.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:21">Yob 12:21</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 12:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:19">Amo 5:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Sisera yairuka, yaahunga, yaahika aha ihema rya Yayeli muka Heberi Omukeeni; ahabw'okuba Yabini omugabe wa Hazori n'ab'enju ya Heberi Omukeeni bakaba nibataahirana. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yayeli yaashohora kubugana Sisera, yaamugira ati: Kiikama, mukama wangye, otaahe omwangye; otatiina. Yaataaha omu ihema rye, yaamushweka burangiti. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:25">Bar 5:25</ref>. </char></note> Onu yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza mpa otwizi tw'okunywa, ahakuba nyine eiriho. Yayeli yaafunduura ecupa y'amate, yaamuha, yaanywa, yaagaruka yaamushweka. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Sisera yaamugira ati: Yemerera aha muryango gw'eihema; ku haraije omuntu weena, yaakubuuza ati: Haine omuntu ori aha? Omugire oti: Ngaaha! <verse eid="JDG 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:26">Bar 5:26</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yayeli muka Heberi yaihayo enkondo y'eihema n'enyondo, yaamwizira naashooba, yaamuteera egyo nkondo omu kanenero agwejegyeire munonga ahabw'okuruha, enkondo yaayogamu, yaahika omu itaka. Atyo Sisera yaafa. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Kandi reeba, Baraki ku yaabaire akikuratiire Sisera, Yayeli yaashohora kumubugana, yaamugira ati: Ija nkworekye omushaija ou orikusherura. Yaataaha omu ihema ry'ogwo mukazi, yaashanga Sisera agangarami afiire, n'enkondo y'eihema ekimuri omu kanenero. <verse eid="JDG 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:24">Neh 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:47">Zab 18:47</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba Ruhanga yaagomoora Yabini omugabe w'Abanyakanaani omu maisho g'Abaisraeli; <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />n'ahabw'ekyo omukono gw'Abaisraeli gwaguma nigweyongyera amaani ahari Yabini omugabe wa Kanaani, okuhitsya obu baamuhwerekyerereize kimwe.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ekyeshongoro kya Debora na Baraki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Eryo izooba Debora na Baraki mwene Abinoamu baayeshongora bati:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Muhimbise MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:2">Ahabw'okuba abeebembezi beebembeire Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:2">N'abantu baayehayo beekundiire.<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Imwe bagabe 'mwe, nimuhurire; naimwe abanyiginya, mutegye amatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">Naaza kweshongorera MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">Nyeshongore eby'okuhimbisa MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />MUKAMA obu waaruga omuri Seiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">Obu waashohora omu nsi ya Edomu noohurura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">Ensi ekatengyeta, n'eiguru ryatengatenga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">Ebicu byatoonya amaizi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:7">Zab 68:7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 68:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 3:3-6">Hab 3:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 64:3">Isa 64:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Enshozi zaahimintika amaizi omu maisho ga MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:5">Nangwa na Sinai yaaba etyo omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Omu biro bya Shamugaari mwene Anasi, n'omu bya Yayeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:6">Emihanda rugyendwa ekaba etarabwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:6">Abagyenzi bakaba bashenshebuka omu tuhanda tw'omu mbaju.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:31">Bar 3:31</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:8">Isa 33:8</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:18">Tonz 4:18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Obwo abategyeki bahweire omuri Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:7">Okuhitsya obu nyowe Debora naimukire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:7">Nkaimuka nk'omuzaire omuri Israeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Baaruhanga basya ku baatairweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">Engamba zaatengyerwa omu marembo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">Ha ngabo, nari icumu, ebyabaireho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">Omu ngabo za Israeli obukumi buna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:19">1 Sam 13:19</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 13:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:3">Bar 4:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Omutima gwangye gwona guri aha beebembezi ba Israeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:9">Abaayehaireyo omu bantu n'omutima gwekundiire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:9">Muhimbise MUKAMA.<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Imwe abagyendera aha ndogoya za kisa, nimukibuzye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:10">Naimwe abashutama aha mikyeeka y'ekikama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:10">Kandi naimwe abagyendesa ebigyere omu mihanda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 12:14">Bar 12:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Hare ei enduuru z'abarikurashana zirikureetwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Ei bataha amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Okwo niyo bariguma nibagambira eby'okuhikiirira ebi MUKAMA yaakozire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Eby'okuhikiirira kw'omu butegyeki bwe omuri Israeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Nibwo abantu ba MUKAMA baashuuma, bakataaha omu marembo.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Sisiimuka, sisiimuka, Debora!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Sisiimuka, sisiimuka, oyeshongore ekyeshongoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Imuka, Baraki, abaabaire bakukwatsire obatware bari enkwatwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Iwe mutabani wa Abinoamu.<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Haashuuma ab'ekitiinisa abaabaire batsigaireho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:13">Abantu ba MUKAMA baashuuma kumurwanira n'ab'amaani.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Baaruga Efuraimu, baaza omu ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">Bakukuratiire, iwe Benyamiini, na beene waanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">Abakuru b'engabo baashuuma nibaruga Makiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">N'omuri Zebuluuni haarugayo abaabaire batwara enkoni y'omukuru w'engabo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:27">Bar 3:27</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:5">4:5</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 4:6">6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Abanyiginya ba Isakaari baija na Debora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">N'abandi ba Isakaari abaabaire bari abeesigwa ahari Baraki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Bairukira omu ruhanga, bamuri omu ntegye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Aha migyera ya Reubeeni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Baagiriraho enaama ehamire.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />N'enki ekikugumize omu bibuga by'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">Kuhurira emikuri ei barikuziteerera?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">Aha migyera ya Reubeeni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">Haabaho okwebuuza kuhango munonga.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:1">Kub 32:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Abagileadi beegumiire obuseeri bwa Yorudani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Abadaani batsigaziibwe ki omu meeri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Abaasheri bagumire beeshutamiire aha nyambukiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Baayegumira omu mikono y'enyanja.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Abazebuluuni n'abantu aboogire amagara gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:18">Tibatiinire kufa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:18">N'Abanafutaali bagiire omu kaso k'orugamba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 4:10">Bar 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:11">Kush 12:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Abagabe baizire, baarwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">Abagabe ba Kanaani baarwanira Tanaki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">Aha migyera ya Megido;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">Kwonka tibaine feeza zi banyagire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 4:16">Bar 4:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Eiguru rihurwire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:20">Enyonyoozi omu ngyendo zaazo zaarwanisa Sisera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:12-14">Yos 10:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:15">Bar 4:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Omugyera Kishoni gwabatwara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:21">Ogwo mugyera gwa ira Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:21">Iwe magara gangye, oribatiriire ab'amaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:40">1 Bag 18:40</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Obwo embaraasi zaabo zairuka nizishaayaguza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:22">Nizishaayaguza n'amaani.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Mukyeene Merozi, nikwo maraika wa MUKAMA arikugira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">Mukyeene munonga abatwireyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">Ahakuba tibaizire kuha MUKAMA emikono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">Kumuha emikono kurwanisa ab'amaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 21:8">Bar 21:8</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 21:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 32:6">Kub 32:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Yayeli aheebwe omugisha okukira abakazi boona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:24">Muka Heberi Omukeeni aheebwe omugisha okukira abakazi abatuura omu mahema.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:28">Luk 1:28</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Ashabire amaizi, yaamuha amate;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:25">Yaamureetera amate g'amakamo omu nkongooro y'ekitiinisa.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Yaatayo omukono, yaihayo enkondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">N'omukono gwe ogwa buryo yaihayo enyondo y'abakozi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">Yaamuteera enkondo omu mutwe n'enyondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">Yaagimuteera omu kanenero, yaayogamu.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisera yaayefunya, yaagwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:27">Yaagangarama aha bigyere bye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:27">Ahu yaagwa, niho yaafeera.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Nyina wa Sisera yaaringuririza omu dirisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">Yaarabya amaisho omu tuhengyere, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">Ahabw'enki ekigaari kye kyasiibayo munonga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">N'enki ekizibiire enyamuziga z'ebigaari bye kwija?<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Abaranga be b'obwengye baamugarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:29">Eki yaaba naateekateeka, bati:<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />Ebyo tibaabona eminyago?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">Tibarikugibagana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">Buri muntu omuzaana omwe nari babiri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">Sisera tarikubagana omunyago gw'emyenda y'ebicwererane by'amabara maingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">N'emyenda y'amabara maingi agacwereraine embaju zombi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">Ey'okukujweka omu bitsya?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:9">Kur 15:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Ai MUKAMA, abazigu baawe boona bacwekyerere batyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:31">Kwonka abarikukukunda babe nk'oku eizooba rituruka n'amaani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Okuruga aho ensi yaahuumura okumara emyaka makumi ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:4">Zab 48:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 48:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:10">Kush 6:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:43">Mat 13:43</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 19:5">Zab 19:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okwitwa kubi Abamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 25:2">Kut 25:2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 25:17">Kub 25:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli baakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA; MUKAMA yaabahayo omu mikono y'Abamidiani okumara emyaka mushanju. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:6">1 Sam 13:6</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:38">Heb 11:38</ref>. </char></note> Abamidiani baasingura Abaisraeli; ahabw'Abamidiani Abaisraeli baayetimbira amaaya omu nshozi, n'enyanga, kandi baayeyombekyera n'engo z'amabaare. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:1">Kur 29:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 4:30">1 Bag 4:30</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Abaisraeli ku baabaire babiba, Abamidiani n'Abaamaleki n'abandi bantu b'oburugwa-izooba baija babateera; <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:16">Lev 26:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:30">Bir 28:30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:17">Yer 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:15">Mik 6:15</ref>. </char></note> basiisirayo kubarwanisa, bashiisha emyaka yaabo okuhika Gaaza, kandi bakaba batatsiga k'okurya koona omu nsi ya Israeli, n'obu yaakuba entaama, nari ente nari endogoya. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Ahakuba bakaba baija n'amatungo gaabo n'amahema gaabo, baija baingi nk'enzigye, bo n'engamira zaabo batarikubaasa kubarwa; bataaha omu nsi kugicwekyereza. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:15">Zab 50:15</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 5:15">Hos 5:15</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baayehwa munonga amatsiko ahabw'Abamidiani; baatakira MUKAMA.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Abaisraeli ku baatakiire MUKAMA ahabw'Abamidiani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />MUKAMA yaabatumaho nabi; yaabagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga w'Abaisraeli arikugamba naagira ati: nkabaiha Misri, naabaiha omu nju y'obuhuuku, <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />naabaiha omu mikono y'Abamisri n'omu mikono y'abandi boona abaabaire nibabaita kubi, naababinga, baabaruga omu maisho, imwe naabaha ensi yaabo. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:2">Yer 10:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naabagira nti: Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mutaritiina baaruhanga b'Abaamori, abu mutwire omu nsi yaabo; kwonka mwayanga kuhurira eiraka ryangye.<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okutoorana Gideoni kujuna Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Maraika wa MUKAMA yaija, yaashutama ahansi y'omwela ahari Ofura eya Yoashi owa Abiezeeri, kandi omutabani Gideoni akaba naahuura engano omu inyuukiro rya viinyo kugishereka Abamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:7-13">Kut 16:7-13</ref>. </char></note> Maraika wa MUKAMA yaamweyoreka, yaamugira ati: MUKAMA ari hamwe naiwe, iwe omushaija w'amaani emanzi. <verse eid="JDG 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:49">Zab 89:49</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:1">Isa 59:1</ref>. </char></note> Gideoni yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, MUKAMA ku araabe ari hamwe naitwe, ahabw'enki ebi byona bitubaireho? Kandi eby'okutangaaza bye byona birahi, ebi baatatenkuriitwe baabaire batugambira, nibagira bati: MUKAMA tiwe yaatwihire omuri Misri? Mbwenu atutsigireho, yaatuhayo omu mikono y'Abamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:32">Heb 11:32</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaamutaho amaisho, yaamugira ati: Gyenda n'amaani gaawe aga, ojune Abaisraeli omu mikono y'Abamidiani. Tiinye naakutuma? <verse eid="JDG 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:21">1 Sam 9:21</ref>. </char></note> Onu ati: Mukama wangye, nimbaasa nta kujuna Abaisraeli? Reeba, ab'omuryango gwaitu n'abooro okukira boona ab'omu ruganda rwa Manaase, kandi omu nju ya taata niinye muto. <verse eid="JDG 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Kur 3:12</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaamugarukamu ati: Buzimazima ndyaba ndi hamwe naiwe, naiwe oryabinga Abamidiani nk'orikubinga omuntu omwe. <verse eid="JDG 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:1">Kur 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Onu ati: Ku oraabe wangirira embabazi, nyoreka ak'okureeberaho akarikuhamya ku niiwe orikugamba naanye. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:3">Kut 18:3</ref>. </char></note> Ninkweshengyereza otaruga aha okuhitsya obu ndaagarukye, nkakureetera omutoijo nkaguta omu maisho gaawe. Yaamugarukamu ati: Niinyija kuguma aha, okuhitsya ahu oraagarukire. <verse eid="JDG 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Atyo Gideoni yaataaha omuka, yaabaaga akaana k'embuzi, yaagira na twakeeki otutatumbisiibwe twa eefa y'esaano; enyama yaagita omu kiibo, n'omucuuzi gwayo yaaguta omu rwabya, yaabimureetera ahansi y'ogwo mwela, yaabimuheereza. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:19">Bar 13:19</ref>. </char></note> Maraika wa Ruhanga yaamugira ati: Twara egi nyama, na twakeeki otutatumbisiibwe, obite aha rukiri oru, obishukyeho n'ogwo mucuuzi. Onu yaakora atyo. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:24">Lev 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:1">2 Bus 7:1</ref>. </char></note> Maraika wa MUKAMA yaagorora omukono gwe ogwabaire gukwaitse enkoni, yaakoza eifundo ryayo aha nyama na twakeeki otutatumbisiibwe; ahonaaho omuriro gwaruga omu rukiri, gwayotsya egyo nyama na twakeeki otwo otutatumbisiibwe; bwanyima maraika wa MUKAMA yaabura, Gideoni tiyaagaruka kumureeba. <verse eid="JDG 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:30">Kut 32:30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 33:20">Kur 33:20</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:22">Bar 13:22</ref>. </char></note> Gideoni ku yaamanyire ku ari maraika wa MUKAMA, yaagira ati: Ntoore hi, Mukama RUHANGA, ahakuba naareebana na maraika wa MUKAMA butunu. <verse eid="JDG 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:19">Dan 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36">Luk 24:36</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaamugarukamu ati: Huumura, otatiina; torikwija kufa. <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:14">Kut 22:14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:15">Kur 17:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:16">Yer 33:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 48:35">Ezk 48:35</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Gideoni yaayombekyerayo MUKAMA eitambiro, yaaryeta Yehova-shaloomu. Rikiri Ofura ey'aba Abiezeeri n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gideoni okusheenya eitambiro rya Baali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:5">Bir 7:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyo kiro MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Twara enimi ya sho, enimi eya kabiri eine emyaka mushanju, osheenye eitambiro rya Baali eriri owa sho, kandi oteme Ashera eri aha rubaju rwaryo; <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />bwanyima oyombekyere MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe eitambiro aha mutwe gw'akabungo akeehinguririziibwe orugo rw'amabaare, oryombekye gye; bwanyima otware egyo nimi ya kabiri, ogihongye kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya, okyokyese enku ezi oraasheenye ahari Ashera. <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Yoh 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Gideoni yaatwara abashaija ikumi ab'omu bairu be, yaakora nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiira; kwonka ahabw'okutiina ab'omu ka ya ishe, n'abantu ab'omuri orwo rurembo, yaakikora nyekiro, tiyaakikora nyomushana.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Ab'omuri orwo rurembo ku baimukire kare omu kasheeshe, baashanga eryo itambiro rya Baali risheenyirwe, na Ashera eyaabaire eri aha rubaju rwaryo etemirwe, n'enimi eya kabiri ehongyeirwe aha itambiro eryombekirwe. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Baabuuzana bati: Okozire eki n'oha? Ku baaherize kubuuririza munonga, baagira bati: Gideoni mwene Yoashi niwe akikozire. <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Bwanyima abantu b'omu rurembo baagira Yoashi bati: Shohoza mutabani waawe, afe, ahabw'okuba asheenyire eitambiro rya Baali, kandi yaatema Ashera ebaire eriri haihi. <verse eid="JDG 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Yoashi yaagarukamu boona abaabaire bamubambiire, ati: Nimwenda kurwanirira Baali, nari kumutonganira? Weena orikumurwanirira, naija kwitwa omuri aka kasheeshe. Baali ku araabe ari Ruhanga, murekye ayerwaniririre, ahakuba eitambiro erisheenyirwe n'erye. <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Nikyo eryo izooba Gideoni yaayeteirwe Yeruba-baali, amakuru ngu, Reka Baali amurwanise, ahakuba asheenyire eitambiro rye.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gideoni okushaba ak'okureeberaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Bwanyima Abamidiani boona n'Abaamaleki kandi n'abantu b'oburugwa-izooba baateeranira hamwe, baayambuka, baasiisira omu ruhita rwa Yezereeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:25">Bar 13:25</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 14:6">14:6</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 14:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2 Bus 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 12:8-11">1 Kor 12:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 3:27">Bar 3:27</ref>. </char></note> Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaija ahari Gideoni, yaateera enzamba; Aba Abiezeeri baayeteerana, baamukurata. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Yaatuma entumwa kuhuruza Abamanaase boona; nabo baayeteerana, baamukurata; kandi yaatuma ezindi ntumwa kuhuruza Abaasheri n'Abazebuluuni n'Abanafutaali; bainamuka kubabugana.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Gideoni yaagambira Ruhanga ati: Ku oraabe noija kujunisa Abaisraeli omukono gwangye, nk'oku ogambire, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:3-7">Kur 4:3-7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:5">Hos 14:5</ref>. </char></note> reeba naaza kuta ebyoya by'entaama omu ihuuriro; ku ndaashangye bitonzirweho orume byonka, haza ahabyehinguririize hoomire, obwo nimmanya ku orikwija kujunisa Abaisraeli omukono gwangye, nk'oku ogambire. <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Kandi nikwo byabaire bityo; Gideoni ku yaimukire omu kasheeshe, yaakamuura ebyoya, byarugwamu orume rwingi, rwaijura orucuba. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:32">Kut 18:32</ref>. </char></note> Gideoni yaagaruka yaagira Ruhanga ati: Otangirira ekiniga, ondekye ngarukye ngambe rimwe kwonka, ndekyere aho. Ninkweshengyereza, reka nteereho ogundi murundi n'ebyoya; mbwenu ebyoya ka bibe nibyo byaguma byomire, haza eitaka ryona ribe niryo ryagiibwaho orume. <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Ruhanga yaakora atyo ekyo kiro; ebyoya byonka byaguma byomire, orume rwaza aha itaka ryona.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s1">Gideoni okubinga Abamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Bwanyima Yeruba-baali niwe Gideoni, n'abantu boona abu yaabaire aine, baimuka kare omu kasheeshe, baasiisira aha rubaju rw'eiziba rya Harodi; kandi orusiisira rw'Abamidiani rukaba ruri aha bukiizi bwabo obwa-bumosho, omu ruhanga haihi n'ekibungo kya Moore. <verse eid="JDG 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:17">Bir 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:4">9:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:16">Zab 33:16</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 33:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:6">Zek 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 4:7">2 Kor 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:9">Efe 2:9</ref>. </char></note>MUKAMA yaagambira Gideoni ati: Abantu abu oine bahinguraine obwingi; n'ahabw'ekyo tindikwija kuhayo Abamidiani omu mikono yaabo, Abaisraeli batakaanyehimbisaho nibagira bati: Emikono yaitu niyo etujunire. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:8">Bir 20:8</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nu gyenda ogambire abantu oti: Orikutiina weena, kandi orikutetema, agarukye omuka. Haagarukayo abantu obukumi bubiri n'enkumi ibiri; haatsigara kakumi.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:6">1 Sam 16:6</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 16:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagaruka yaagambira Gideoni ati: Abantu bakihinguraine; bashuumye aha mugyera, mbakugyererezeho; kandi ou ndaakugire nti, Ogu agyende naiwe, agyende naiwe; na weena ou ndaakugire nti, Atagyenda naiwe, atagyenda naiwe. <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Atyo yaashuumya abo bashaija aha maizi; MUKAMA yaagira Gideoni ati: Omuntu weena oraanywaise amaizi orurimi nk'embwa, omwegyekye hangahari; kandi weena oraatsimbe amaju kunywa, omute ahakwe. <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Abaatahiise amaizi engaro, bakaganywaisa orurimi, baaba magana ashatu; kwonka abandi boona baanywa batsimbire amaju. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:6">1 Sam 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:14">Isa 41:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Gideoni ati: Abashaija magana ashatu abaanywaisa amaizi orurimi nibo ndaabajunise, nkahayo Abamidiani omu mikono yaawe; reka abandi boona bagarukyeyo, buri muntu omu ka ye. <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Atyo Gideoni yaayaka abo bantu entanda zaabo n'enzamba zaabo; bwanyima yaaboohereza boona, buri muntu omu ihema rye, kwonka yaaguma n'abo magana ashatu; kandi orusiisira rw'Abamidiani rukaba ruri ahaifo ye omu ruhita.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Ekyo kiro MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Imuka oshuume, oteere orusiisira, ahakuba nduhaireyo omu mikono yaawe. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Kwonka ku oraabe nootiina kushuumayo, gyenda n'omugaragwa waawe Puuri omuri orwo rusiisira; <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:9">1 Sam 14:9</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 14:10">10</ref>. </char></note> noija kuhurira ebi barikugamba; bwanyima emikono yaawe neija kugira amaani g'okuruteera. Atyo yaashuuma n'omugaragwa we Puura, yaahika aha ngabo ezirikubandizibwaho ezaabaire ziine eby'okurwanisa nizirinda orusiisira. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:5">Bar 6:5</ref>. </char></note> Abamidiani n'Abaamaleki n'abantu boona ab'oburugwa-izooba bakaba bateekire enteeko omu ruhita, bari baingi nk'enzigye, n'engamira zaabo zikaba zitarikubaasa kubarwa, ziri nk'omusheenyi gw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja. <verse eid="JDG 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:14">Isa 41:14</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 41:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:27">1 Kor 1:27</ref>. </char></note> Gideoni ku yaahikireyo, yaahurira omuntu omwe omuribo naarootororera mugyenzi we ekirooto, naagira ati: Reeba ndootsire ekirooto, ngu omugaati gwa sayiri gugwire omu rusiisira rw'Abamidiani, gwateera eihema, eryo ihema ryakumbagara, ryagwa rigarami. <verse eid="JDG 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:8">Kut 40:8</ref>. </char></note> Mugyenzi we yaamugarukamu ati: Ekyo ti kindi; ni rurara ya Gideoni mwene Yoashi, omushaija w'omu Baisraeli; Ruhanga ahaireyo Abamidiani n'eihe ryona omu mikono ye.<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gideoni ku yaahuriire ekyo kirooto n'oku baakishoboorora, yaaramya Ruhanga, yaagaruka omu rusiisira rw'Abaisraeli, yaagira ati: Mwimukye, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ahaireyo eihe rya Midiani omu mikono yaanyu. <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:9">Kub 10:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6:4">Yos 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:6">Amo 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Yaabaganisa abo bashaija magana ashatu omu mitwe eshatu, boona yaabakwatsa enzamba n'enyungu zirimu busha, n'emuri omuri ezo nyungu. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Yaabagira ati: Mundeebereho; oku ndaagire, mube nikwo mwagira. Ku ndaahikye ahu orusiisira rurikutandikira, mukore eki ndaakore. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Ku ndaateere enzamba, n'abandi boona abari hamwe naanye, naimwe muteerere enzamba aha mbaju zoona ez'orusiisira rwona, nimugira muti: Ahabwa MUKAMA n'ahabwa Gideoni.<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubingwa kw'Abamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Atyo Gideoni n'abashaija igana abu yaabaire aine baahika ahu orusiisira rurikutandikira, abantu baahirwayo, ahu abarinzi ba kabiri batandikira; baateera enzamba, baayata enyungu ezi baabaire baine omu ngaro. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Egyo mitwe eshatu y'engabo baateerera hamwe enzamba, baayata enyungu, bakwaitse emuri omu ngaro zaabo za bumosho, n'enzamba z'okuteera ziri omu za buryo; baateera orwari nibagira bati: Rurara ya MUKAMA n'eya Gideoni. <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:13">Kur 14:13</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:17">2 Bus 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 7:7">2 Bag 7:7</ref>. </char></note> Buri muntu yaayemerera omu mwanya gwe, beehinguriririize orusiisira; engabo zoona ez'Abamidiani zairuka niziyogoorekana, zaahunga. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:20">1 Sam 14:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:2">Isa 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:23">2 Bus 20:23</ref>. </char></note> Abantu abo magana ashatu baagumizamu nibateera enzamba, MUKAMA yaitanisa Abamidiani na rurara, buri muntu yaita mugyenzi we, eihe ryona ryaitana, ryahunga, ryahika Besi-shiita ehereraine na Zerera, baahika aha mwatano gwa Abeli-mehola haihi na Tabasi. <verse eid="JDG 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Abashaija ba Israeli baahurura nibaruga Nafutaali na Ashera na Manaase yoona, baakurata Abamidiani.<verse eid="JDG 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 3:27">Bar 3:27</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 3:28">28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gideoni yaatuma entumwa omu nsi yoona ey'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, naagira ati: Mushuume, murwanise Abamidiani, mubatangire aha maizi okuhika Besi-baara, n'aha mugyera Yorudani. Batyo abashaija boona Abaefuraimu baahurura, baakwata amaizi goona okuhika Besi-baara, n'omugyera Yorudani. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:11">Zab 83:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:26">Isa 10:26</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baakwata abanyiginya babiri ba Midiani, Orebu na Zeebu; Orebu baamwitira aha rukiri rwa Orebu, na Zeebu baamwitira aha inyuukiro rya Zeebu; baagumizamu baakurata Abamidiani; kandi baareetera Gideoni omutwe gwa Orebu n'ogwa Zeebu seeri ya Yorudani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s1">Gideoni okwita abagabe b'Abamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 12:1">Bar 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:41">2 Sam 19:41</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abashaija ba Efuraimu baamubuuza bati: Otutuzire ki okutatuhuruza, nooza kurwana n'Abamidiani? Baamutonganisa munonga. <verse eid="JDG 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Nawe yaabagarukamu ati: Nkozire ki ekirikwingana n'ebi mukozire? Emizaabibu y'empumbano eya Efuraimu terikuhita icwa ryona ery'emizaabibu ya Abiezeeri? <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:1">Enf 15:1</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga ahaireyo abanyiginya ba Midiani Orebu na Zeebu omu mikono yaanyu. Mbwenu shi nyowe eki nkozire ekirikukira ebi mukozire niki? Ku yaabagambiire ekyo, ekiniga kyabo kyaikaikana.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Gideoni yaija yaayambuka Yorudani n'abo bantu magana ashatu, abu yaabaire aine, bagwire enshazi kwonka babakuratiire. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Yaagira abantu ba Sukoosi ati: Naabeeshengyereza mumpeere aba bantu bankuratiire emigaati, ahakuba baagwa enshazi, kandi nkibingire Zeeba na Zalumuuna, abagabe ba Midiani. <verse eid="JDG 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:11">1 Sam 25:11</ref>. </char></note> Abategyeki ba Sukoosi baagira bati: Zeeba na Zalumuuna waabakwatsire, tukabona kuheereza engabo zaawe eby'okurya? <verse eid="JDG 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gideoni yaagira ati: MUKAMA ku araaheyo Zeeba na Zalumuuna omu mikono yangye, emibiri yaanyu niinyija kugitaaguza amahwa g'omu ihamba n'ag'emikwata-ngwe. <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Yaarugayo, yaaza Penueli, nabo yaabagambira ebigambo nk'ebyo; kandi aba Penueli baamugarukamu nk'eby'aba Sukoosi. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Yaagambira aba Penueli ati: Ku ndaabe naagarukire n'obusingye, niinyija kusheenya ogu munaara.<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 7:12">Bar 7:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo Zeeba na Zalumuuna bakaba bari Karikoori n'engabo zaabo akakumi kamwe n'enkumi itaano, abaahonokire aha ngabo zoona ez'eihe ry'ab'oburugwa-izooba; ahabw'okuba hakafa abantu akasiriira kamwe n'obukumi bubiri, enkwata-rurara. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:27">Bar 18:27</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:3">1 Tes 5:3</ref>. </char></note> Gideoni yainamuka, yaatoora omuhanda ogurikuraba omu bantu abaabaire batuura omu mahema aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba bwa Nooba na Yogibeha, yaasingura eryo ihe; ahakuba rikaba ryehugiireho. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:11">Zab 83:11</ref>. </char></note> Zeeba na Zalumuuna abagabe bombi ba Midiani baahunga, yaababinga, yaabakwata, kandi engabo zaabo zoona yaazihahaaza emitima, zaataataana.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Bwanyima Gideoni mwene Yoashi yaatabaaruka omu rugamba, yaaraba aharikwinamuka Heresi; <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />yaakwata omutsigazi wa Sukoosi, yaamubuuza abategyeki n'abakuru ba Sukoosi, onu yaamuhandiikira amaziina gaabo, abashaija makumi mushanju na mushanju. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Atyo yaija aha ba Sukoosi, yaagira ati: Mureebe Zeeba na Zalumuuna, abu munteerereireho enaku, nimugira muti, Zeeba na Zalumuuna waabakwatsire, tukabona kuha engabo zaawe ezirikugwa enshazi eby'okurya? <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Yaatwara abakuru b'orurembo, n'amahwa g'omu ihamba n'ag'emikwatangwe, yaageegyesesa aba Sukoosi. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Kandi yaasheenya omunaara gwa Penueli, yaita abashaija b'omuri orwo rurembo.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Bwanyima yaabuuza Zeeba na Zalumuuna ati: Abashaija abu mwaitiire Tabora bakaba nibashusha ki? Baamugarukamu bati: Nk'oku orikushusha, nabo nikwo baabaire nibashusha. Buri omwe akaba naashusha omwana w'omugabe. <verse eid="JDG 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Yaagira ati: Abo bakaba bari bakuru bangye, abaana ba maawe. Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire, kuri noogira ngu mukabakiza, naanye tinkubaitsire. <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Yaagambira Yeseri omujigaijo gwe, ati: Imuka, obaite. Kwonka omutsigazi ogwo tiyaihayo rurara ye; yaatiina, ahabw'okuba akaba akiri omutsigazi. <verse eid="JDG 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Bwanyima Zeeba na Zalumuuna nikwo kumugira bati: Imuka, obe niiwe waatwita, ahakuba nk'oku omuntu arikwingana, n'amaani ge nikwo gaingana. Atyo Gideoni yaimuka, yaita Zeeba na Zalumuuna, yaajuura engamira zaabo ebirezi ebi zaabaire zijwaire omu bitsya.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gideoni okwanga kwemekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Bwanyima Abaisraeli baagambira Gideoni bati: Otutegyekye, iwe na mutabani waawe, na mwijukuru waawe; ahabw'okuba otukirize Abamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:7">1 Sam 8:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:19">10:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:13">Isa 26:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:10">Hos 13:10</ref>. </char></note> Gideoni yaabagarukamu ati: Tindibategyeka, na mutabani wangye taribategyeka; kureka MUKAMA niwe aribategyeka. <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:10">1 Tim 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Gideoni yaabagira ati: Nyine eki ndikubashaba; buri muntu ampe empeta z'omu matu ezi anyagire. (Ahakuba Abamidiani bakaba bajwara empeta z'ezaabu omu matu, ahabw'okuba bakaba bari Abaishimaeli.) <verse eid="JDG 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Baamugarukamu bati: Twaza kuzikuha n'omutima gwekundiire. Baayara omwenda ahansi, buri muntu yaanagaho empeta z'omu matu ezi anyagire. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Oburemeezi bw'empeta zaabo ez'ezaabu z'omu matu ezi yaashabire bwaba shekeli z'ezaabu rukumi na magana mushanju, otabariiremu birezi n'eby'okwehunda n'ebijwaro bya bujwa ebyabaire bijwarwa abagabe ba Midiani, kandi otataireho mikuufu ey'omu bitsya by'engamira zaabo. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 17:5">Bar 17:5</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 18:14">18:14</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 18:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:33">Kur 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:39">Zab 106:39</ref>. </char></note> Gideoni yaabikoramu efodi, yaagita omu rurembo rwe orurikwetwa Ofura; Abaisraeli boona baaguma nibazayo kugiramya nk'abarikuraaya; yaaba omutego ahari Gideoni n'ab'omu ka ye. <verse eid="JDG 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Batyo Abamidiani baasingurwa Abaisraeli, tibaagaruka kwimutsya mutwe obundi. Ensi yaahuumura okumara emyaka makumi ana omu busingye bwa Gideoni.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Yeruba-baali mwene Yoashi yaagyenda, yaatuura omu nju ye ey'obutaka. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:2">Bar 9:2</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 9:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Gideoni akaba aine abaana b'aboojo makumi mushanju, abu yaayezaariire; ahabw'okuba akaba aine abakazi baingi. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Kandi akaba aine omukazi w'ekinyanshunju omuri Shekemu; nawe yaamuzaarira omwana w'omwojo, yaamweta Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Bwanyima Gideoni mwene Yoashi yaafa yaahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru, yaaziikwa Ofura ey'aba Abiezeeri omu kituuro kya Yoashi ishe.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:19">Bar 2:19</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 9:4">9:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho Gideoni ku yaaherize kufa, Abaisraeli baagaruka baaramya Baabaali nk'abarikuraaya, kandi baahindura Baaliberisi ruhanga waabo. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:11">Zab 78:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:13-21">106:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:32">Yer 2:32</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli tibaijuka MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, owaabaire abaiha omu mikono y'abazigu baabo boona, abaabaire baba babeehinguririize; <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:16">Bar 9:16</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:14">Mub 9:14</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 9:15">15</ref>. </char></note> kandi tibaagirira mbabazi ab'enju ya Yeruba-baali, niwe Gideoni, ahabw'ebirungi byona ebi yaakoreire Israeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abimeleki okwita batabani ba Gideoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 8:31">Bar 8:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abimeleki mwene Yeruba-baali yaaza Shekemu, yaashangayo ab'oruganda rwa nyina, yaabagambira hamwe n'oruganda rwona orwa ishenkuru kizaara-nyina, ati: <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:14">Kut 29:14</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 29:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Nimbeeshengyereza mubuuze aba Shekemu boona muti: Ekirungi ahariimwe nikiiha, okutegyekwa batabani ba Yeruba-baali makumi mushanju, nari okutegyekwa omwe? Kandi mwijukye ku ndi owaanyu w'aha mara. <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Ab'oruganda rwa nyina baamugambirira aba Shekemu boona ebigambo ebyo byona, emitima y'aba Shekemu yaasiima kwija kukurata Abimeleki; ahakuba bakagira bati: Ni mwene waitu. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:3">Bar 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:7">2 Bus 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:5">Byak 17:5</ref>. </char></note> Baiha omu nju ya Baali-berisi ebicweka by'efeeza makumi mushanju, baabiha Abimeleki, nawe yaabiha abantu abataine mugasho, ebizahambuki, yaabaguriirira, baamukurata. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:1">2 Bag 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:16">Mat 2:16</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 2:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Yaaza Ofura owa ishe, yaashangayo beene ishe, batabani ba Yeruba-baali makumi mushanju, yaabaitira aha rukiri; kwonka Yosamu mutabani wa Yeruba-baali omuto yaaba niwe yaahonokaho, ahakuba akeeshereka. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Aba Shekemu boona baayeteerana n'ab'enju ya Miilo boona, baagyenda baayemekyera Abimeleki aha mwela gw'enyomyo y'omuri Shekemu.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu ya Yosamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Ku baakigambiire Yosamu, yaagyenda, yaayemerera aha mutwe gw'ekibungo kya Gerizimu yaabeeta n'eiraka rihango, naagira ati: Imwe bantu ba Shekemu 'mwe, nimumpurire, naimwe Ruhanga abone kubahurira. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:9">2 Bag 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 8:22">Bar 8:22</ref>. </char></note> Eizooba rimwe emiti ekaimuka, yaaza kweteeraho omugabe w'okugitegyeka; yaagambira omuzeituuni eti: Tutegyekye. <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:15">Zab 104:15</ref>. </char></note> Omuzeituuni gwagigira guti: Mbwenu nimwenda ngu ntsigyeho amajuta gangye agarikuhaisa Ruhanga n'abantu ekitiinisa, nze kwecunda ahaiguru y'emiti? <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Egyo miti yaagira omutiini eti: Ija, otutegyekye. <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Kwonka omutiini gwagigarukamu guti: Mbwenu nimwenda ngu ntsigyeho obunuzi bwangye n'ebijuma byangye birungi, nze kwecunda ahaiguru y'emiti? <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Egyo miti yaagira omuzaabibu eti: Ija, otutegyekye. <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Omuzaabibu gwagigarukamu guti: Nimwenda ngu ntsigyeho viinyo yangye egwisa gye Ruhanga n'abantu, nze kwecunda ahaiguru y'emiti? <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Bwanyima emiti yoona yaagira omukwatangwe eti: Ija, otutegyekye. <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:12">Dan 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 21:28">Kub 21:28</ref>. </char></note> Omukwata-ngwe gwagigarukamu guti: Ku muraabe nimuunyemeka omu mazima, mwije mwegame omu kicuucu kyangye; kwonka ku kiraabe kitari kityo, omuriro ka gurugye omu mukwata-ngwe, gwokyeze kimwe emyereezi ya Lebanooni. <verse eid="JDG 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 8:35">Bar 8:35</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ku muraabe mukozire omu bwesigwa n'omu mazima omu kwemeka Abimeleki, kandi ku muraabe mukozire gye Yerubabaali n'ab'omu ruganda rwe, mukamukorera ebishemereire ebi yaakozire <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />(ahakuba taata akabarwanirira, yaayoga amagara, yaabaiha omu mikono y'Abamidiani; <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />mbwenu eri izooba mwaimukira eka ya taata, mwaita abatabani makumi mushanju, mwabaitira aha rukiri, mwayemeka Abimeleki omwana w'omuzaanakazi kutegyeka abantu ba Shekemu, ahabw'okuba ni mwene waanyu) <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:6">Isa 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:16">Yak 4:16</ref>. </char></note> mbwenu ku muraabe mukoreire Yeruba-baali n'ab'omu ruganda rwe eby'obwesigwa n'eby'amazima eri izooba, mwesiime ahabwe, nawe ayesiime ahabwanyu. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Kwonka ku kiraabe kitari kityo, omuriro ka gurugye ahari Abimeleki, gwokyeze kimwe aba Shekemu n'ab'enju ya Miilo; kandi n'omuriro gugarukye gurugye omu ba Shekemu n'omu b'enju ya Miilo, gwokyeze kimwe Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:16">Kub 21:16</ref>. </char></note> Yosamu yairuka, yaahungira Beeri, yaatuurayo ahabw'okutiina Abimeleki mukuru we.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuhoora Abimeleki enzigu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimeleki yaamara emyaka eshatu naategyeka Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:14">1 Sam 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:15">1 Bag 12:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:2">Isa 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:1">Isa 33:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mat 7:2</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaatuma omuzimu kwanganisa Abimeleki n'aba Shekemu; aba Shekemu baamugirira enaama y'okumureebya, <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />ngu okwita kubi oku yaitsire batabani ba Yeruba-baali makumi mushanju, n'eshagama yaabo, bigwere mwene waabo Abimeleki, owaabaitsire, kandi bigwere n'aba Shekemu abaamuhaire emikono y'okwita beene ishe. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Aba Shekemu baata abantu aha mitwe y'ebibungo kumugwera, kandi baaguma nibanyaga abantu boona abaabaire nibabarabaho omuri ogwo muhanda. Ekyo kyagambirwa Abimeleki.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Bwanyima Gaali mwene Ebedi yaija na beene waabo, baaza Shekemu; aba Shekemu baamwesiga; <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />baaza omu misiri, baacwa emizaabibu, baaginyuuka, baagira obugyenyi, baataaha omu nju ya ruhanga waabo, baarya, baanywa, baajuma Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gaali mwene Ebedi yaagira ati: Abimeleki niwe oha, kutegyeka itwe aba Shekemu? Mwene Yeruba-baali na Zebuli omukungu we bakaba batarikutegyekwa aba Hamori ishe wa Shekemu? Ahabw'enki itwe tushemereire kumuheereza? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Kuri noogira ngu niinye ndikutegyeka aba bantu, nkaihireho Abimeleki, mmugira nti: Teerana engabo zaawe zoona, oshohore!<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebuli omutegyeki w'orurembo ku yaahuriire ebigambo bya Gaali mwene Ebedi, yaagira ekiniga; <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />yaatuma entumwa ahari Abimeleki bwesherekye, naagira ati: Reeba, Gaali mwene Ebedi na beene ishe baizire Shekemu, nibaimukiriza orurembo kukugomera. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Mbwenu nu, imuka oije nyekiro, iwe n'abantu abu oine, ogwere omu misiri. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Omu kasheeshe eizooba nirituruka, mwimukye mweshukye aha rurembo, muruteere; we n'abantu abu aine ku baraije kukurwanisa, obagire nk'oku orikubaasa.<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Abimeleki n'abantu boona abu yaabaire aine baimuka nyekiro, baayebaganisamu emitwe ena, baagwera Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Gaali mwene Ebedi yaashohora, yaayemerera omu irembo ry'orurembo; ahonaaho Abimeleki n'abu yaabaire aine baimuka ahu baabaire bagwereire. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gaali ku yaareebire abo bantu, yaagira Zebuli ati: Reeba abantu nibashuuma, nibaruga aha mutwe gw'ebibungo. Zebuli yaamugira ati: Nooreeba ebiinyimanyimi by'ebibungo, oshusha oti n'abantu. <verse eid="JDG 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Gaali yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Reeba abantu nibashuuma, baahika rwagati y'ebibungo, kandi n'ogundi mutwe gwaija nigureetwa omu muhanda gw'omwela gw'abafumu. <verse eid="JDG 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:8">2 Bag 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:28">Yer 2:28</ref>. </char></note> Zebuli nikwo kumutsyorera ati: Nya myehimbiso yaawe eri erahi, iwe ogizire oti: Abimeleki n'oha itwe kumuheereza? Bariya tibo bantu abu ogayire? Mbwenu irooko orwane nabo. <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Gaali yaaza yaayebembera aba Shekemu, yaarwanisa Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Abimeleki yaamubinga, onu yaamuhunga; baingi baahutaara, baagyenda nibagwa omu muhanda gwona okuhika aha irembo ry'orurembo. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimeleki yaatsigara Aruma, na Zebuli yaabinga Gaali na beene waabo, ngu barekye kuguma omuri Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Ku bwaseesire, abantu baashohora, baaza omu misiri; kyagambirwa Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Yaatwara engabo ze, yaazicwamu emitwe eshatu, baagwera omu misiri; ku yaimukize amaisho, yaareeba abantu nibaruga omu rurembo, yaimuka, yaabateera, yaabaita. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimeleki n'omutwe ogu yaabaire aine bairuka, baayemerera omu irembo ry'orurembo; emitwe endiijo ebiri yaagwa aha bantu boona abaabaire bari omu misiri, baabaita. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:23">Bir 29:23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 3:25">2 Bag 3:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:16">Zab 9:16</ref>. </char></note> Abimeleki yaarenzya eizooba naarwanisa orwo rurembo; yaarukwata, yaita abantu abaabaire barurimu; yaarusheenyagura, yaarumemeereramu omwonyo.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 8:33">Bar 8:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu boona ab'omunaara gwa Shekemu ku baakihuriire, baahungira omu kishengye ky'okuzimu eky'omu nju ya Eliberisi. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Baagambira Abimeleki ku abantu boona ab'omunaara gwa Shekemu beeteeraine hamwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Abimeleki n'abantu boona abu yaabaire aine bainamuka omu kibungo kya Zalumooni; yaakwata empango, yaatema eitaagi omu miti; yaaritwara aritaire aha ibega; yaagira abantu abu yaabaire aine ati: Oku mwareeba ningira, naimwe murahukye mube nikwo mwagira. <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Abantu boona buri muntu nikwo kutema eitaagi rye, bakakurata Abimeleki, bakageegyekyerera ekyo kishengye, baakookyezamu abantu abaabaire barimu; batyo abantu boona ab'omunaara gwa Shekemu baafa, haafeeramu abantu nka rukumi, abashaija n'abakazi.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Bwanyima Abimeleki yaaza Tebeza, yaagiteeraho orusiisira kugirwanisa, yaagikwata. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Kwonka omuri orwo rurembo hakaba harimu omunaara gugumire; abantu boona ab'omu rurembo, abashaija n'abakazi baaguhungiramu, baayekingirana, baatemba aha mutwe gwagwo. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleki yaahika aha munaara, yaaguteera, yairira haihi n'orwigi rwagwo kurwotsya n'omuriro. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 4:17">Bar 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 11:21">2 Sam 11:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:20">Yer 49:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:45">50:45</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:27">1 Kor 1:27</ref>. </char></note> Omukazi yaarekyera eseiso, yaagiteera Abimeleki omutwe, yaagwata. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:4">1 Sam 31:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho Abimeleki yaayeta omutsigazi owaabaire amutwarira eby'okurwanisa, yaamugira ati: Ihayo rurara yaawe, onyite, abantu batakaagira ngu yaitwa omukazi. Ogwo mutsigazi we yaamutimbura, yaafa. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Abaisraeli ku baareebire Abimeleki yaafa, baarugayo, buri muntu yaataaha omu ka ye. <verse eid="JDG 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:5">Kut 9:5</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 9:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:12">Zab 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:7">Gal 6:7</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo Ruhanga yaahoire Abimeleki enzigu ahabw'ekibi eki yaakoreire ishe, obu yaita beene ishe makumi mushanju; <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />kandi ebibi byona ebi aba Shekemu baakozire Ruhanga yaabibazimuurira; baagiibwaho omukyeeno gwa Yosamu mwene Yeruba-baali.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s1">Abandi baramuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Bwanyima ya Abimeleki Toola mwene Pua, mwijukuru wa Dodo ow'omu ruganda rwa Isakaari yaimuka kujuna Israeli; akaba atuura Shamiri omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Yaamara emyaka makumi abiri n'eshatu naacwera Abaisraeli emanja; bwanyima yaafa, yaaziikwa omuri Shamiri.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Bwanyima ye haimuka Yairi Omugileadi, nawe yaamara emyaka makumi abiri n'ebiri naacwera Abaisraeli emanja. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:10">Bar 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:14">Bir 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Akaba aine abatabani makumi ashatu, abaabaire bagyendera aha ndogoya nto makumi ashatu, kandi baine endembo makumi ashatu omu nsi ya Gileadi ezaabaaire nizeetwa Havosi-yairi n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yairi yaafa, yaaziikwa Kamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okwimuura Ruhanga n'okwitwa kubi Abaamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:11">Bar 2:11</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 2:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:1">6:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:23">2 Bus 28:23</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:33">1 Bag 11:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli baagaruka baakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, baaheereza Baabaali n'Ashitaroosi, na baaruhanga ba Siria, na Sidoni, na Moabu n'Abaamoni n'Abafilistia, baimuura MUKAMA, tibaamuheereza. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />MUKAMA yaagirira Israeli ekiniga kingi, yaabahayo omu mikono y'Abafilistia n'ey'Abaamoni. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Omu mwaka ogwo baaburabuza Abaisraeli, baabaita kubi; baamara emyaka ikumi na munaana nibaita kubi Abaisraeli boona abaabaire batwire seeri ya Yorudani omu nsi y'Abaamori ey'omuri Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Kandi Abaamoni baayambuka Yorudani kurwanisa Abayuda n'Ababenyamiini n'ab'oruganda rwa Efuraimu; n'ahabw'ekyo Abaisraeli baatuntuzibwa munonga.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 12:10">1 Sam 12:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli baatakira MUKAMA, nibagira bati: Tukucumwireho, ahakuba tukaimuura Ruhanga waitu, twaheereza Baabaali. <verse eid="JDG 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:30">Kur 14:30</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:8">1 Sam 12:8</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagarukamu Abaisraeli ati; Tindabajunire Abanyamisri n'Abaamori n'Abaamoni kandi n'Abafilistia? <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:3">Bar 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:42">Zab 106:42</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:43">43</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'aba Sidoni n'Abaamaleki n'aba Maoni bakabaita kubi, mwantakira, naabaiha omu mikono yaabo. <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:9">1 Bus 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:13">Yer 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka mwanyimuura, mwaheereza baaruhanga abandi; n'ahabw'ekyo tindigaruka kubajuna. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:13">2 Bag 3:13</ref>. </char></note> Mugyende mutakire baaruhanga abu mwayetooraniire; babe nibo baabajuna omu biro by'okutuntuzibwa kwanyu. <verse eid="JDG 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:27">1 Bag 21:27</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baagarukamu MUKAMA bati: N'ekya buzima tukashiisha; mbwenu otukore kyona eki orikwenda; kwonka nitukweshengyereza otujune eri izooba. <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:14">2 Bus 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:44">Zab 106:44</ref>. </char></note> Baiha baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga omuribo, baaheereza MUKAMA; omutima gwe gwashaasha munonga ahabw'obusaasi bw'Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Bwanyima Abaamoni baayeteerana, bateera orusiisira omuri Gileadi; n'Abaisraeli nabo baayeteerana, baateera orusiisira omuri Mizipa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Kandi abantu bakuru ba Gileadi, baagambirana bati: N'oha oraabanze kurwana n'Abaamoni? Ogwo niwe araabe mukuru w'abatwire omuri Gileadi boona.<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yefusa okutooranwa kuba omuramuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 6:12">Bar 6:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yefusa Omugileadi akaba ari emanzi rugambwa, kwonka akaba ari omwana wa maraaya; Gileadi niwe yaamumuzaireho. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Kandi muka Gileadi akaba amuzaariire abaana b'aboojo. Batabani b'omukazi we abo ku baakuzire, baabinga Yefusa, baamugira bati: Torigira buhunguzi mu ka ya tataitwe, ahabw'okuba ori omwana w'ondiijo mukazi. <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:4">Bar 9:4</ref>. </char></note> Yefusa nikwo kuhunga beene ishe, akatuura omu nsi ya Toobu; abantu abaabaire bataine mugasho baaguma nibateeranira ahari Yefusa, nibahurura nawe.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Ku haahingwireho ebiro, Abaamoni baateera Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Abaamoni ku baabateire, abakuru ba Gileadi baaza kuhuruza Yefusa omu nsi ya Toobu; <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />baamugira bati: Ija obe omukuru w'eihe ryaitu, tubone kurwanisa Abaamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:27">Kut 26:27</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Yefusa yaabagarukamu ati: Tiimwe mwanyangire, mukambinga omu ka ya taata? Ahabw'enki mwaija kunsherura, obu muri omu busaasi? <verse eid="JDG 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 10:18">Bar 10:18</ref>. </char></note> Abakuru ba Gileadi baamugarukamu bati: Ekyatureetera kukugarukira, nitwenda ngu ogyende naitwe, turwanise Abaamoni, kandi obe omukuru w'abatwire omuri Gileadi boona. <verse eid="JDG 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefusa yaabuuza abakuru ba Gileadi ati: Ku murangarure owaitu kurwanisa Abaamoni, MUKAMA yaabahayo omu mikono yangye, n'ekya buzima ndyaba omukuru waanyu? <verse eid="JDG 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:5">1 Tes 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Abakuru ba Gileadi baamugarukamu bati: MUKAMA niwe ariba mushinja ahagati yaitu; buzimazima turyakora nk'oku waagamba. <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 10:17">Bar 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:17">1 Sam 10:17</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Yefusa yaagyenda n'abakuru ba Gileadi, abantu baamuhindura omukuru waabo w'okubeebembera. Yefusa yaagambira ebigambo bye byona omu maisho ga MUKAMA omuri Mizipa.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Entumwa za Yefusa okubuuza Abaamoni ekirikwenda kubarwanisa nabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Yefusa yaatuma entumwa aha mugabe w'Abaamoni, naamubuuza ati: Nontura ki okwija kuteera ensi yangye? <verse eid="JDG 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:24">Kub 21:24</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe w'Abaamoni yaagarukamu entumwa za Yefusa ati: Ahakuba Abaisraeli ku baabaire nibaruga Misri, baanyaga ensi yangye okuruga Arunooni okuhika Yaboki na Yorudani; mbwenu gigarure n'obusingye. <verse eid="JDG 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefusa yaagaruka yaatuma entumwa aha mugabe w'Abaamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:9">Bir 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 2:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:10">2 Bus 20:10</ref>. </char></note> yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo Yefusa arikugira ati: Israeli taranyagire nsi ya Moabu n'obu yaakuba ey'Abaamoni; <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:26">Kub 13:26</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:25">14:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:46">Bir 1:46</ref>. </char></note> kureka Abaisraeli bakaruga Misri, baaraba omu ihamba okuhika aha Nyanja erikutukura; bwanyima baahika Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:14">Kub 20:14</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho Israeli yaatuma entumwa aha mugabe wa Edomu, naagira ati: Twakweshengyereza, reka turabe omu nsi yaawe; omugabe wa Edomu tiyaikiriza. Kandi yaatuma atyo aha mugabe wa Moabu; kwonka nawe tiyaikiriza. Israeli nikwo kuguma Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Bwanyima baaraba omu ihamba, baayekiikuura ensi ya Edomu n'eya Moabu, baaraba aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba rw'ensi ya Moabu, baateera amahema seeri ya Arunooni; kwonka tibaarenga mwatano gwa Moabu, ahakuba omwatano gwayo ni Arunooni. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21">Kub 21:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 2:26">Bir 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:1-17">3:1-17</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Israeli yaatuma entumwa ahari Sihooni omugabe w'Abaamori, omugabe wa Heshibooni, naamugira ati: Twakweshengyereza, reka turabe omu nsi yaawe, tuze owaitu. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Kwonka Sihooni tiyaayesiga Baisraeli kurenga omwatano gwe, kureka yaateerana abantu be boona, yaateera orusiisira Yahazi, yaarwanisa Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:24">Kub 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 2:33">Bir 2:33</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 2:34">34</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli yaahayo Sihooni n'abantu be boona omu mikono y'Abaisraeli, baabasingura. Batyo Abaisraeli baakubuura ensi yoona ey'Abaamori abaabaire batwiremu. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Baakubuura ensi yoona ey'Abaamori okuruga Arunooni okuhika Yaboki, kandi okuruga aha ihamba n'okuhika Yorudani. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Atyo MUKAMA Ruhanga w'Abaisraeli yaabinga Abaamori omu maisho g'abantu be Abaisraeli. Mbwenu niimwe mwakushemereire kugikubuura? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:29">Kub 21:29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:7">Yer 48:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:16">Bir 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:2">Zab 44:2</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 44:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Torikubuura ensi ei Kemoshi ruhanga waawe arikuha? Naitwe abantu boona abu MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaabingire omu maisho gaitu, nibo turaakubuure ensi yaabo. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:2">Kub 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:3">Bir 23:3</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 23:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Oine eki orikukiza Balaki mwene Zipori omugabe wa Moabu? Akaba arahakaniiseho Abaisraeli, nari akaba arabarwaniiseho? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Abaisraeli ka baamazire emyaka magana ashatu, batwire omuri Heshibooni n'omuri tauni zaayo, n'omuri Aroeri na tauni zaayo, n'omu ndembo zoona eziri aha mbaju za Arunooni! Ahabw'enki omuri egyo myaka yoona ezo ndembo timurazigarukaine? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:25">Kut 18:25</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:15">Yob 9:15</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo tiinye nkukozire kubi, kureka niiwe onkozire kubi kundwanisa. MUKAMA Omucwi w'emanja abe niwe yaaramura Abaisraeli n'Abaamoni eri izooba. <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Kwonka omugabe w'Abaamoni tiyaata mutima ha bigambo ebi Yefusa yaamutumireho.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhiga kwa Yefusa n'okusingura Abaamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaija ahari Yefusa; Yefusa yaaraba omuri Gileadi na Manaase, yaahika Mizipa eya Gileadi; yaarugayo yaahika omu Baamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:20">Kut 28:20</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Yefusa yaahiga ahari MUKAMA naagira ati: Buzimazima ku oraaheyo Abaamoni omu mikono yangye, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:2">Lev 27:2</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam 1:11</ref>. </char></note> ku nditabaaruka gye ninduga kurwanisa Abaamoni, ekiribanza kushohora omu muryango gw'enju yangye kumbugana, kiryaba ekya MUKAMA, kandi ndyakihonga, kibe ekitambo ky'okwotsya. <verse eid="JDG 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Atyo Yefusa yaayambuka aha Baamoni kubarwanisa; MUKAMA yaabahayo omu mikono ye. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Yaabateera okuruga Aroeri okuhika Miniisi, yaabaitamu abantu baingi munonga, yaakwata endembo makumi abiri okuhika ahari Abeeli-keramimu. Okwo nikwo Abaamoni baasingwirwe Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yefusa okubugana muhara we n'okumuhayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:20">Kur 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 18:6">1 Sam 18:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yefusa yaatabaaruka, yaagaruka omu ka ye Mizipa; reeba, muhara we yaashohora kumubugana, naateera ebitaasa naazina; niwe yaabaire ari omwana we nyamunegyere; akaba ataine mwana ondiijo weena, yaaba w'omwojo nari w'omwishiki, okwihaho ogwo. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:36-38">Kut 42:36-38</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 18:33">2 Sam 18:33</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 5:2-5">Mub 5:2-5</ref>. </char></note> Yefusa ku yaamureebire, yaataagura ebijwaro bye, yaagira ati: Ai bambe, mwana wangye! Ka wangwisiza akagwe, okandeetera amaganya maingi; ahakuba nkaashamya akanwa kangye ahari MUKAMA; tinkibaasa kukireka. <verse eid="JDG 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:2">Kub 30:2</ref>. </char></note> Muhara we yaamugarukamu ati: Taata, ku oraabe waayashamize akanwa kaawe ahari MUKAMA, ongire nk'ekyarugire omu kanwa kaawe oku kiri, nk'oku MUKAMA akuhooreire Abaamoni abazigu baawe. <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Yaagaruka yaagira ishe ati: Ninkushaba onyikirize eki; ondekye ameezi abiri, nze omu bibungo, ngyendagyende na bagyenzi bangye, ncurire obuhangare bwangye. <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Yaamugira ati: Irooko. Yaamwohereza okumara ameezi abiri; yaagyenda na bagyenzi be, yaacurira obuhangare bwe omu bibungo. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Ameezi abiri ku gaahweire, yaagaruka ahari ishe, yaamugira nk'oku yaaraganiise; kandi omwishiki ogwo akaba atakamanyaga mushaija. <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />Gwahinduka omugyenzo omuri Israeli, abaishiki ba Israeli okuguma nibagyenda buri mwaka kumara ebiro bina nibacurira muhara wa Yefusa Omugileadi.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s1">Abaefuraimu okurwanisa Abagileadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 8:1">Bar 8:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 19:5">1 Sam 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:4">Rom 16:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaefuraimu baahuruzibwa kurwana, baayambuka, baahika Zafoni, baayetomboitera Yefusa, nibagira bati: Ahabw'enki oyambukire kurwanisa Abaamoni, otatwete kuhurura naiwe? Nitwija kukwokyeza omu nju. <verse eid="JDG 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Yefusa yaabagarukamu ati: Nyowe n'abantu bangye tukaba twine empaka nyingi n'Abaamoni; kandi ku twabeetsire, timwabatujuna. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Ku naareebire mutaatujuna, naayoga amagara, naayambuka kurwanisa Abaamoni, kandi MUKAMA yaabahayo omu mikono yangye. Mbwenu ahabw'enki mwaija eri izooba kundwanisa? <verse eid="JDG 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:9">Zab 78:9</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho Yefusa yaahuruza Abagileadi boona, yaabarwanisiza Efuraimu; Abagileadi baasingura Abaefuraimu; ahakuba bakabatsyorera bati: Imwe Abagileadi, muri Abaefuraimu abaacwire omu nsi ya Efuraimu n'eya Manaase. <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:28">Bar 3:28</ref>. </char></note> Abagileadi baakwata enyambukiro za Yorudani kutangaho Abaefuraimu ngu batambuka. Omuefuraimu weena ku yaabaire aba naahunga, yaahika aha nyambukiro, yaashaba kwambuka, Abagileadi bamubuuza bati: Ori Omuefuraimu? Ku yaabaire agira ati: Ngaaha, <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />bamugira bati: Gira oti, Shiboleesi, nawe agira Siboleesi, ahabw'okutabaasa kukigamba gye, bamukwata, bamwitira ahari ezo nyambukiro za Yorudani. Omu bunaku obwo haafa Abaefuraimu obukumi buna n'enkumi ibiri. <verse eid="JDG 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yefusa yaamara emyaka mukaaga naacwera Abaisraeli emanja. Bwanyima Yefusa Omugileadi yaafa, yaaziikwa omu rurembo rumwe aha ndembo z'omuri Gileadi.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Bwanyima ye Ibuzaani owa Betelehemu yaaba omuramuzi w'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Akaba aine abatabani makumi ashatu na bahara be makumi ashatu abu yaahingiire omu zindi nganda; kandi akashwerererayo abatabani abakazi makumi ashatu. Yaamara emyaka mushanju naacwera Abaisraeli emanja. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Bwanyima Ibuzaani yaafa, yaaziikwa Betelehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Bwanyima ye haazaho Elooni Omuzebuluuni, yaaba omuramuzi w'Abaisraeli; yaamara emyaka ikumi naabacwera emanja. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Bwanyima Elooni Omuzebuluuni yaafa, yaaziikwa Ayalooni omu ishaza rya Zebuluuni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Bwanyima ye haazaho Abudooni mwene Hileeli owa Piratooni, yaaba omuramuzi w'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Akaba aine abatabani makumi ana n'abaijukuru b'aboojo makumi ashatu; boona makumi mushanju bakaba bagyendera aha ndogoya nto makumi mushanju. Yaamara emyaka munaana naacwera Abaisraeli emanja. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Bwanyima Abudooni mwene Hileeli owa Piratooni yaafa, yaaziikwa Piratooni omu ishaza rya Efuraimu omu nsi y'ebibungo ey'Abaamaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s1">Maraika okweyoreka Manoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 10:6">Bar 10:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:9">1 Sam 12:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Abaisraeli bakagaruka baakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA; MUKAMA yaabahayo omu mikono y'Abafilistia okumara emyaka makumi ana.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Hakaba hariho omushaija wa Zoora, ow'omu ruganda rwa Daani, orikwetwa Manoa; omukazi we akaba ari engumba, ataine mwana weena. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:7-13">Kut 16:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:2-6">Kur 3:2-6</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:12">Bar 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:11">Luk 1:11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:28">28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:30">Byak 7:30</ref>. </char></note> Maraika wa MUKAMA yaayeyoreka ogwo mukazi, yaamugira ati: Reeba mbwenu ori engumba, torikuzaara; kwonka noija kugira enda, ozaare omwana w'omwojo. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:2-5">Kub 6:2-5</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo oyerinde, otarinywa viinyo nari ekirikusinza, kandi otarirya ekintu kyona ekirikuzira; <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:13">7:13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 8:1">2 Sam 8:1</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba reeba, noija kugira enda, ozaare omwana w'omwojo; kandi orumweiso tirurimuraba ha mutwe; ahakuba ogwo mwana aryaba <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omunaziiri reeba Okubara 6.2 amakuru ngu, omuntu oshoroirwe kukorera Ruhanga omu muringo ogutari gw'obutoosha. </char></note>Omunaziiri ahari Ruhanga okuruga omunda ya nyina; kandi niwe aritandika kujuna Abaisraeli omu mikono y'Abafilistia. <verse eid="JDG 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:3">Mat 28:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:29">Luk 9:29</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ogwo mukazi yaija, yaagambira iba ati: Omushaija wa Ruhanga yaanyijaho, enshusha ye yaaba eri nk'eya maraika wa Ruhanga orikutiinisa munonga; tinaamubuuza i yaaba naaruga, kandi tiyangambira iziina rye; <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />kwonka yaangira ati: Reeba noija kugira enda, ozaare omwana w'omwojo; kandi ati: otarinywa viinyo nari ekirikusinza, n'obu kwakuba okurya ekintu kyona ekirikuzira; ahabw'okuba ogwo mwana aryaba Omunaziiri ahari Ruhanga okuruga omunda ya nyina okuhitsya aha izooba eri arifeeraho.<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Bwanyima Manoa yaayeshengyereza MUKAMA, naagira ati: Ai MUKAMA, ninkweshengyereza oikirize ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga ou waatuma atugarukyeho, atushobororere oku turitwaza omwana orizaarwa. <verse eid="JDG 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Ruhanga yaahurira okushaba kwa Manoa; maraika ori owa Ruhanga yaagaruka ahari ogwo mukazi, yaashanga ashutami omu musiri; kwonka Manoa iba atariho. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Omukazi yairukisa obwira, yaagambira iba ati: Reeba omushaija onyizireho omu biro ebihingwire yaagaruka yaanyeyoreka. <verse eid="JDG 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa yaimuka, yaakurata omukazi we, yaahika ahari ogwo mushaija, yaamubuuza ati: Niiwe mushaija ogambire n'omukazi wangye? Onu ati: Niinye. <verse eid="JDG 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Manoa yaagira ati: Mbwenu ebigambo byawe ku biriba byabaire kwo, aryaba omwana wa muringo ki, kandi aryakora murimo ki? <verse eid="JDG 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Maraika wa MUKAMA yaagira Manoa ati: Byona ebi ngambiire omukazi waawe, abyerinde. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Tarikwikirizibwa kurya ekintu kyona ekirikuruga omu muzaabibu, n'obu kwakuba okunywa viinyo nari ekirikusinza, nari okurya ekintu kyona ekirikuzira; byona ebi mmuragiire, ashemereire kubyorobera.<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:5">Kut 18:5</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:18-20">Bar 6:18-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manoa yaagira maraika wa MUKAMA ati: Reka tukukyerereze tukubaagire omwana gw'embuzi. <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Maraika wa MUKAMA yaagira Manoa ati: N'obu orankyerereze, tindikwija kurya by'okurya byawe; kandi ku oraayende kugira ekitambo ky'okwotsya, oshemereire kukihongyera MUKAMA; ahakuba Manoa taramanyire ku yaabaire ari maraika wa MUKAMA. <verse eid="JDG 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Manoa yaabuuza maraika wa MUKAMA ati: Eiziina ryawe ori oha, ebigambo byawe ku biriba byabaire kwo, tubone kukuha ekitiinisa? <verse eid="JDG 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:29">Kut 32:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isa 9:6</ref>. </char></note> Maraika wa MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Nombuuriza ki eiziina? Ka n'ery'okutangaaza! <verse eid="JDG 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Manoa nikwo kureeta omwana gw'embuzi n'empongano y'esaano, akabihongyera MUKAMA aha rukiri; maraika akakora eby'okutangaaza, Manoa n'omukazi we nibamureeba. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:24">Lev 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 21:16">1 Bus 21:16</ref>. </char></note> Endimi z'omuriro ku zaimukire ahaiguru niziruga aha itambiro, maraika wa MUKAMA yaatembera omuri ezo ndimi ezaaruga aha itambiro, Manoa n'omukazi we nibabireeba; ku baabireebire, baagwa ahansi bajuumaire.<verse eid="JDG 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Maraika wa MUKAMA tiyaagaruka kweyoreka obundi ahari Manoa n'omukazi we. Okuruga aho Manoa yaamanya ku abaire ari maraika wa MUKAMA. <verse eid="JDG 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:20">Kur 33:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:26">Bir 5:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:5">Isa 6:5</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Manoa yaagambira omukazi we ati: Buzimazima nitwija kufa, ahabw'okuba twareeba Ruhanga. <verse eid="JDG 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Kwonka omukazi we yaagira ati: Kuri noogira ngu MUKAMA abaire naayenda kutwita, takwakiire kitambo ky'okwotsya n'empongano y'esaano ebi twamuhongyera, kandi takutworekire ebyo byona, n'obu kwakuba okutugambira ebigambo ebyo byona omu bunaku obu.<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzaarwa kwa Samusooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Bwanyima ogwo mukazi yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, yaamweta Samusooni; omwana yaakura, kandi MUKAMA yaamuha omugisha. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:10">Bar 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:34">6:34</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:29">11:29</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 11:6">1 Sam 11:6</ref>. </char></note> Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaatandika kumukoresa omuri Mahane-daani ahagati ya Zoora na Eshitaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s1">Samusooni okwita entare n'okushwera muhara w'Abafilistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:37">Zab 119:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Samusooni yaashuuma Timuna, yaareebayo omwishiki, muhara w'Abafilistia. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:21">Kut 21:21</ref>. </char></note> Yainamuka, yaagambira ishe na nyina ati: Ndeebire omwishiki muhara w'Abafilistia omuri Timuna; mbwenu niinyenda ngu mumunshwererere. <verse eid="JDG 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:3">Kut 24:3</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 24:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:3">Bir 7:3</ref>. </char></note> Ishe na nyina baamugira bati: Beitu shi omuri beene waitu nari omu ihanga ryaitu tiharimu omwishiki, iwe waaza kwenda kushwera omu Abafilistia abatashazirwe? Samusooni yaagarukamu ishe ati: Nyowe munshwererere, ahakuba nanshemeza munonga. <verse eid="JDG 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 10:15">2 Bus 10:15</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ishe na nyina tibaramanyire ku yaabaire eri enaama ya MUKAMA, ahakuba akaba naasherura obwiho bw'okurwana n'Abafilistia. Omu bunaku obwo Abafilistia bakaba nibategyeka Abaisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Atyo Samusooni yaashuuma Timuna na ishe na nyina, yaahika omu misiri y'emizaabibu yaayo, yaateerateeraniramu n'ekitsigazi ky'entare, kyamutontomera; <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:6">1 Sam 11:6</ref>. </char></note> Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaamwijaho n'amaani, yaakitaagataagura nk'orikutaagataagura omwana gw'embuzi, haza ataine ki akwaitse; kwonka tiyaagambira ishe na nyina ki yaakora. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Samusooni yaashuuma, yaagaaniira n'ogwo mwishiki, yaamushemeza munonga. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Ku haahingwireho omwanya, yaagarukayo kumutwara; yaakiikama aha rubaju kureeba omutumbi gw'entare eri; ku yaahikireho, yaashanga gurimu omuzinga gw'enjoki n'obwoki. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Yaabubomboora n'engaro, yaagyenda naaburya, yaagaruka ahari ishe na nyina; nabo yaabahaho, baarya; kwonka tiyaabagambira ku yaabwiha omu mutumbi gw'entare.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Ishe yaashuuma ei ogwo mwishiki yaabaire ari; Samusooni yaateekyerayo obugyenyi, nk'oku omucwe gw'abatsigazi gwabaire guri. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Ku baamureebire, baamureetera bagyenzi baabo makumi ashatu kumwikaza. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:2">Ezk 17:2</ref>. </char></note> Samusooni yaabagira ati: Ka mbahe ekishaakuzo; ku muraakiite ebiro mushanju by'obugyenyi bitakahweire, mwakimanya muti, nimbaha ebijwaro bya bafuta makumi ashatu, n'ebindi eby'ekitiinisa makumi ashatu. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Kwonka ku muraabe mutakiitsire, nimumpa ebijwaro bya bafuta makumi ashatu n'ebindi eby'ekitiinisa makumi ashatu. Baamugira bati: Kishaakuze, tukihurire. <verse eid="JDG 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Yaabagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">Omuri rurya harugiremu eby'okurya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">Kandi omu w'amaani harugiremu obunuzi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:14">Baamara ebiro bishatu batakiitsire. <verse eid="JDG 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 16:5">Bar 16:5</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro kya kana baagambira muka Samusooni bati: Beihabeiha baro atwitire ekyo kishaakuzo, tutakwotsya n'enju ya sho. Mutwetsire kutuhindura abooro? Tikwo kiri? <verse eid="JDG 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 16:15">Bar 16:15</ref>. </char></note> Muka Samusooni yaamuririra omu maisho, naagira ati: Biri onyanga, tonkunda. Ohaire ab'owaitu ekishaakuzo, haza tiwaakinyitira. Onu ati: Ku ndaabe ntakigambiire tata na maawe, nimbaasa nta kukikugambira? <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Yaamara ebyo biro by'obugyenyi byona naamuririra omu maisho; aha kiro kya mushanju yaakimugambira, ahabw'okuba akamutonga amagara; nawe yaakigambira beene waabo. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Aha kiro kya mushanju eizooba ritakarengire, abantu b'omuri orwo rurembo baamugira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Ekirikukiza obwoki obunuzi niki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Kandi ekirikukiza entare amaani n'enki?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">Samusooni yaabagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Kuri mutahingiise nyana yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Timwakwitsire kishaakuzo kyangye.<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 11:6">1 Sam 11:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:13">16:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaamwijaho n'amaani, yaashuuma Ashikelooni, yaitayo abashaija makumi ashatu, yaabanyaga, yaaha abaitsire ekyo kiito ebijwaro by'ekitiinisa. Yaagira ekiniga kingi, yainamuka, yaataaha omu ka ya ishe. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 15:2">Bar 15:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka muka Samusooni baamuhingira mugyenzi we, owaamugambiire obugyenyi.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s1">Samusooni okurwanisa Abafilistia n'okubaitamu baingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:20">1 Sam 16:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:29">Luk 15:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haahingwireho omwanya omu igyesha ry'engano, Samusooni yaaza kureeba omukazi we, yaamutwarira omwana gw'embuzi; yaagira ati: Ka nze ow'omukazi wangye omu kishengye. Kwonka ishezaara tiyaamwikiriza kutaahamu. <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Ishezaara yaamugira ati: Buzimazima nkateekateeka ngu okamwangira kimwe; n'ahabw'ekyo nkamuhingira mugyenzi waawe. Omurumuna tarikumuhita? Naakweshengyereza, ba niwe waatwara omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="JDG 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samusooni yaabagira ati: Mbwenu ku ndaabe naakozire Abafilistia kubi, tihaine orancwere orubanja. <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Samusooni yaagyenda, yaakwata zaamuha magana ashatu, yaatwara enkanza z'omuriro, yaakomerana emikira ya zaamuha, yaagyenda naata enkanza emwe ahagati y'emikira ebiri. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Ku yaaherize kwatsya enkanza, yaazirekura, zaaza omu misiri y'engano y'Abafilistia, zaayotsya ebiba by'engano n'engano zitakatemire, kandi n'omu misiri y'emizeituuni. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:15">Bar 14:15</ref>. </char></note> Abafilistia baabuuza bati: Okozire eki n'oha? Baagarukamu bati: Ni Samusooni mukwe w'Omunyatimuna, ahakuba akamwaka omukazi we, yaamuha mugyenzi we. Abafilistia bainamuka, baayotsya ogwo mukazi na ishe, baafa. <verse eid="JDG 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samusooni yaabagira ati: Nk'oku mukozire mutyo, buzimazima niinyija kubahoora enzigu; ku ndaaheze, ndekyere aho. <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Yaabateera, yaabacoocoora, yaita baingi munonga; bwanyima yaashuuma, yaaguma omu nyanga y'orukiri rwa Etamu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Abafilistia bainamuka, baateera orusiisira omu ishaza rya Yuda, baajanjaara omuri Leehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Abantu ba Yuda baababuuza bati: Ahabw'enki mwaija kuturwanisa? Baagarukamu bati: Twaija kuboha Samusooni kumugira nk'oku atugizire. <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:4">Bar 14:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:40-42">Zab 106:40-42</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija ba Yuda enkumi ishatu nikwo kushuuma aha nyanga y'orukiri rwa Etamu, bakagira Samusooni bati: Torikumanya ku Abafilistia barikututegyeka? Mbwenu eki, otukozire ki? Samusooni yaabagarukamu ati: Nk'oku bangizire, naanye nikwo mbagizire. <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Baamugira bati: Twizire kukuboha, tukuheyo omu mikono y'Abafilistia. Samusooni yaabagira ati: Nimundahire imwe ku muraabe mutarikwija kunkombeera. <verse eid="JDG 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Baamugarukamu bati: Ngaaha! Kwonka itwe nitwija kukuboha, tukuhamye, tukuheyo omu mikono yaabo; buzimazima titurikwija kukwita. Batyo baamubohesa emirunga ebiri misya, baamwiha ahari orwo rukiri, baamwinamura.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Ku yaahikire Leehi, Abafilistia baija kumubugana nibateera akaari; Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaamwijaho n'amaani, emirunga eyaabaire emuri aha mikono yaaba nka furakisi eyaayokibwa omuriro; ebyabaire bimubohire byamuruga aha mikono, byaragara. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:10">Yos 23:10</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 3:31">Bar 3:31</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 23:8">2 Sam 23:8</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaagiire kugira ati, yaagwa aha igufa ry'oruba rusya rw'endogoya, yaarukununkirira, yaarwitsa abantu rukumi. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Bwanyima yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">N'oruba rw'endogoya, emirundo n'emirundo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">N'oruba rw'endogoya nyitsire abantu rukumi.<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Ku yaaherize kugamba, yaanaga orwo ruba; kandi omwanya ogwo gukaba nigwetwa Ramasi-Leehi.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Bwanyima yaagira eiriho ringi, yaatakira MUKAMA naagira ati: Otuhaire okujunwa oku okuhango, nootujunisa omukono gw'omwiru waawe; mbwenu nyitwe eiriho, ngwe omu mikono y'abatashazirwe? <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:29">Isa 40:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:15">57:15</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaayashamura enonko eyaabaire eri omuri Leehi, haarugamu amaizi; ku yaaherize kuganywa, omutima gwamugaruka omunda, yaagarukwamu amaani. Nikyo omwanya ogwo gwayeteirwe Eni-hakore, amakuru ngu, eiziba ry'owaatakire; kandi eryo iziba rikiri omuri Leehi n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="JDG 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:1">Bar 13:1</ref>. </char></note> Samusooni yaamara emyaka makumi abiri naacwera Abaisraeli emanja omu biro by'Abafilistia.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s1">Samusooni okubeihwabeihwa baamaraaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Samusooni yaaza Gaaza, yaareebayo maraaya, yaataaha omu nju ye. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:10-12">Zab 118:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:2">Byak 9:2</ref>. </char></note> Baakigambira aba Gaaza bati: Samusooni ari aha. Baayehinguririza omwanya ogu yaabaire arimu, baamara ekiro kyona bamugwereire aha irembo ry'orurembo; ekyo kiro baakimara bahunami, nibagira bati: Murekye busheeshe, tumwite. <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Samusooni yaabyama okuhitsya omu itumbi; eitumbi ku ryahinzire, yaimuka, yaakwata enyigi z'eirembo ry'orurembo n'ebiti by'amarembo byombi, yaabikuurirana n'empimbi zaabyo, yaabita aha mabega, yaabitwara aha mutwe gw'ekibungo ekiri omu maisho ga Heburooni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Bwanyima yaakunda omukazi ow'omu ruhita rwa Sooreki, owaabaire naayetwa Delila. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:15">Bar 14:15</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 2:16-19">Enf 2:16-19</ref>. </char></note> Abategyeki b'Abafilistia baija owe, baamugambira bati: Omubeihabeihe, omanye ei amaani ge maingi gakomooka, n'oku twakumubaasa, tukamuboha, tukamucwa eishaija; haza buri omwe omuriitwe naija kukuha ebicweka by'efeeza rukumi n'eigana. <verse eid="JDG 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Delila yaagira Samusooni ati: Nyaabura 'we, ngambira ei amaani gaawe maingi gakomooka, kandi n'eki baakukubohesa, kikakucwa eishaija. <verse eid="JDG 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samusooni yaamugira ati: Ku baakumbohesa enshuri mbisi mushanju ezitakoomire, obwo nkaahwa amaani, mba nk'abandi bantu. <verse eid="JDG 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 6:24-26">Enf 6:24-26</ref>. </char></note> Abategyeki b'Abafilistia nikwo kumureetera enshuri mbisi mushanju ezitakoomire, akazimubohesa. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Kandi akaba aine abashaija abaabaire bagwereire omu kishengye ky'omunda. Yaamugira ati: Samusooni, waafa, Abafilistia baakwita! Samusooni yaacwa ezo nshuri, nk'akagoye k'obugoigo oku kacweka kaahikwaho omuriro. Obwo tibaamanya i amaani ge gakomooka. <verse eid="JDG 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Delila yaagira Samusooni ati: Reeba wanshungisa, tiwangambira mazima; mbwenu naakweshengyereza, ngambira eki baakukubohesa. <verse eid="JDG 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Yaamugira ati: Ku baakumbohesa emirunga misya etakagizire ki yaaboha, obwo nkaahwa amaani, mba nk'abandi bantu. <verse eid="JDG 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 7:22">Enf 7:22</ref>. </char></note> Delila nikwo kureeta emirunga misya, akagimubohesa, akamugira ati: Samusooni, waafa, Abafilistia baakwita. Kandi abashaija abaabaire bagwereire bakaba bari omu kishengye ky'omunda. Egyo mirunga yaagicwa nk'ehuuzi, yaamuruga aha mikono.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila yaagira Samusooni ati: N'okuhitsya hati nookinshungisa, torikungambira mazima; ngambira eki baakukubohesa. Onu yaamugira ati: Ku waakutsiba obutsibo bw'eishokye ryangye mushanju, waaburukirana n'omwenda ogurikurukirwa aha biti, waabuhamisa orubambo, obwo nkaahwa amaani, mba nk'abandi bantu. <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Atyo yaabuhamisa orubambo, yaamugira ati: Samusooni, waafa, Abafilistia baakwita! Yaasisiimuka, yaakuura orwo rubambo n'ebyo biti n'ogwo mwenda.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 14:16">Bar 14:16</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 5:3-14">Enf 5:3-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Delila yaamugira ati: Noobaasa ota kugira oti, Ninkukunda, haza omutima gwawe gutandiho? Onshungiise emirundi egi yoona eshatu, kandi otarikungambira i amaani gaawe maingi gakomooka. <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Ku yaamucondoorize munonga buri izooba, yaaguma naamujugutirira, Samusooni yaarugaho yaaremba; <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:2">2 Bus 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 6:5">Kub 6:5</ref>. </char></note> nikwo kumugambira omubonano gwe gwona, akamugira ati: Orumweiso tirukandabaga ha mutwe, ahakuba okwiha obu naaruga omunda ya maawe, ntuura ndi Omunaziiri ahari Ruhanga. Ku baakuumwa, obwo nkaahwamu amaani, mba otaine maani, nk'abandi bantu.<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Delila ku yaareebire yaamugambira omubonano gwe gwona, yaatuma kweta abategyeki b'Abafilistia naagira ati: Mwije obu bwonka, ahakuba yangambira omubonano gwe gwona. Ahonaaho abategyeki b'Abafilistia baija owe, baine empiiha omu ngaro zaabo. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:25">Mub 7:25</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 7:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Delila yaamugwejegyereza aha maju ge; yaayeta omushaija, yaamugambira kumumwa obutsibo bw'eishokye rye mushanju; yaatandika kumwita kubi, amaani gaamuhweramu kimwe. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:42">Kub 14:42</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 14:43">43</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 18:12">1 Sam 18:12</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:15">28:15</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 28:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:16">Zab 33:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:23">Yer 9:23</ref>, <ref loc="JER 9:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Samusooni, waafa, Abafilistia baakwita! Yaasisimuka, yaagira ati: Ka nshohore nyekunkumure nk'okwangye. Kwonka akaba atamanyire ku MUKAMA amurugireho. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Abafilistia baamukwata, baamwihamu amaisho, baamushuumya Gaaza, baamukomesa emihama y'emiringa; yaaguma naakora omurimo gw'okusa omu nju y'embohe. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Kwonka eishokye rye ryagaruka ryamera bwanyima y'okumumwa.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Samusooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Abategyeki b'Abafilistia baateerana abantu okutambira Dagoni ruhanga waabo ekitambo kihango, n'okwesiima; ahakuba bakagira bati: Ruhanga waitu ahaireyo Samusooni omuzigu waitu omu mikono yaitu. <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:9">1 Sam 31:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:3-8">Zab 115:3-8</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:4">Dan 5:4</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Abantu ku baamureebire, baasiima ruhanga waabo; ahakuba bakagira bati: Ruhanga waitu ahaireyo omu mikono yaitu omuzigu waitu obaire naahwerekyereza ensi yaitu, naatwitamu abantu baingi. <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:15">Est 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima emitima yaabo ku yaashemerereirwe munonga, baagira bati: Mwete Samusooni, atuzaanire. Baayeta Samusooni kuruga omu nju y'embohe; yaabazaanira; baamuta ahagati y'enyomyo. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samusooni yaagambira omwojo owaabaire amukwaitse omukono, ati: Ka nkorakoze, nkwate enyomyo ezi enju ehamiizeho, nzeegamire. <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:8">Bir 22:8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:6">Yos 2:6</ref>. </char></note> Obwo enju ekaba eijwire abashaija n'abakazi; n'abategyeki b'Abafilistia boona bakaba barimu; kandi n'aha mutwe gw'enju hakaba hariho abantu nk'enkumi ishatu, abashaija n'abakazi, abaabaire nibareeba Samusooni oku arikubazaanira.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Samusooni yaatakira MUKAMA ati: Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga, ninkweshengyereza mpa amaani omurundi ogu gwonka, mpoore Abafilistia ahabw'amaisho gangye gombi. <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Samusooni yaakwata ezo nyomyo ez'ahagati zombi, ezi enju yaabaire ehamiizeho; yaazeegamira, emwe yaagikwatsa omukono gwe gwa buryo, n'endiijo ogwa bumosho. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Samusooni yaagira ati: Ka ngwane n'Abafilistia. Yainama n'amaani ge goona; ahonaaho enju yaagwera abategyeki n'abantu boona abaabaire bagirimu. N'ahabw'ekyo abu yaitsire omu kufa kwe baakira abu yaitsire akihuriire. <verse eid="JDG 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Bwanyima beene waabo n'ab'enju ya ishe boona baashuuma, baamutwara, baamuziika omu kituuro kya Manoa ishe, ahagati ya Zoora na Eshitaoli; obwo akaba amazire emyaka makumi abiri naacwera Abaisraeli emanja.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Miika n'ekishushani kye eky'okuramya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Hakaba hariho omushaija omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, owaabaire naayetwa Miika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Yaagira nyina ati: Ebicweka by'efeeza biri rukumi na igana, ebi baakwibire, bikakureetera kukyeena, nkuhuriire, reeba niinye mbiine. Niinye naabiibire. Nyina yaamugarukamu ati: Mwana wangye, MUKAMA akuhe omugisha. <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Kur 20:4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:4-8">Zab 115:4-8</ref>. </char></note> Miika ku yaagaruriire nyina ebyo bicweka by'efeeza rukumi na igana, nyina yaagira ati: Ebi bicweka by'efeeza ebindi omu ngaro, naabishoroorera MUKAMA, ngu omwana wangye abiheeshemu ekishushani ekisharwire; na mbwenu niinyija kubikugarurira. <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 46:6">Isa 46:6</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize kugarurira nyina ezo feeza, nyina yaatwaraho ebicweka magana abiri, yaabiha omuheesi, yaabiheeshamu ekishushani kisharwire; kyaguma omu nju ya Miika. <verse eid="JDG 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 8:27">Bar 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 18:14">18:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omushaija ogwo Miika akaba aine endaaro ya baaruhanga be, yaakora efodi na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">terafimu n'ebishushani by'emandwa. </char></note>terafimu, kandi yaashoroora omwe aha batabani kuba omunyamurwa we. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 21:25">Bar 21:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:8">Bir 12:8</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo hakaba hatariho mugabe omuri Israeli, kureka buri muntu akaba naayekorera nk'oku arikwenda.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="RUT 1:1">Rus 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="RUT 1:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:1">Mat 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 2:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 2:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi hakaba hariho omutsigazi owa Betelehemu-yuda, ow'omu ruganda rwa Yuda, Omuleevi, owaabaire ashuhuukiireyo. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Omushaija ogwo yaaruga omu rurembo rwa Betelehemu-yuda, yaaza kusherura ah'okutuura. Ku yaabaire naakigyenda, yaahika aha nju ya Miika omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Miika yaamubuuza ati: Nooruga hi? Onu ati: Ndi Omuleevi owa Betelehemu-yuda, ninza kusherura ah'okutuura. <verse eid="JDG 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:19">Bar 18:19</ref>. </char></note> Miika yaamugira ati: Tuura naanye, ombeere omuzaire kandi omunyamurwa; naanye ngume nkuhe ebicweka by'efeeza ikumi buri mwaka, nkujwekye kandi nkugaburire. Atyo ogwo Muleevi yaataahamu. <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Bwanyima yaasiima kuguma n'ogwo mushaija; ogwo mutsigazi yaamubeera nk'omwe aha batabani. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Miika yaashoroora ogwo Muleevi, yaaba omunyamurwa we, yaaguma omu nju ye. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Bwanyima Miika yaagira ati: Mbwenu nimmanya ngu MUKAMA naija kumpa omugisha, obu ngizire Omuleevi omunyamurwa wangye.<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s1">Abadaani okusherura ensi nsya, n'okunyaga Miika ebishushani bye n'omunyamurwa we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 21:25">Bar 21:25</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 19:47">Yos 19:47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo hakaba hatariho mugabe omuri Israeli; kandi omu biro ebyo ab'oruganda rwa Daani bakaba nibasherura ensi y'okutuuramu; ahabw'okuba okuhitsya omu bunaku obwo bakaba batakatungire buhunguzi omu nganda za Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:17">Kub 13:17</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 17:1">Bar 17:1</ref>. </char></note> Abadaani baiha omu ruganda rwabo rwona abashaija bataano amamanzi, baabatuma okuruga Zoora na Eshitaoli kuza kutata ensi n'okugyetegyereza; baabagira bati: Nimwirooko mwetegyereze ensi. Baahika aha nju ya Miika omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, baaraarayo. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Ku baabaire bari haihi n'enju ya Miika, baamanya eiraka ry'ogwo mutsigazi Omuleevi, baakiikama, baamubuuza bati: Okureetsire aha n'oha? Aha nookoraho ki, kandi oineho murimo ki? <verse eid="JDG 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:12">Yoh 10:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 10:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Onu ati: Oku nikwo Miika yantwarize, akandaganisa ebihembo kumukorera; naanye nkaba omunyamurwa we. <verse eid="JDG 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:5">1 Bag 22:5</ref>. </char></note> Baamugira bati: Twakweshengyereza, buuza Ruhanga, tumanye yaaba nitwija kugira omugisha omuri orurugyendo rwaitu. <verse eid="JDG 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:6">1 Bag 22:6</ref>. </char></note> Omunyamurwa yaabagarukamu ati: Mugyende n'obusingye; MUKAMA naija kubarinda omu rugyendo rwanyu.<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Abo bashaija bataano baagyenda, baahika Laishi, baareeba abantu abaabaire bariyo, beetuuriire n'obusingye, nk'oku omucwe gw'Abasidoni gwabaire guri, batuurize, bataine ki beetaireho; bakaba bari abatungi bataine ki bakyenire omu nsi; bari hare n'Abasidoni, bataine bandi boona abu barikukwatanisa nabo. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Ku baagarukire ahari beene waabo omuri Zoora na Eshitaoli, beene waabo baababuuza bati: Nigaahi? <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:7-9">Kub 14:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:23">Yos 2:23</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 2:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:3">1 Bag 22:3</ref>. </char></note> Banu bati: Mwimukye tuze kubateera; ahakuba tureebire ensi, kandi ensi egyo ni nungi munonga. Mushutikirwe ki? Murekye kweziringa, muze omuri egyo nsi, mugikubuure. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:9">Bir 8:9</ref>. </char></note> Ku muraagyende, nimwija kushangayo abantu abeetuuriire n'obusingye, kandi n'ensi eri mpango; buzima Ruhanga agihaireyo omu mikono yaanyu; n'ensi etabuziremu kintu kyona eky'omu nsi. <verse eid="JDG 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Bwanyima abashaija magana mukaaga ab'omu ruganda rwa Daani, baaruga Zoora na Eshitaoli, bakwaitse eby'okurwanisa. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Bainamuka, baateera orusiisira Kiryasi-yearimu omuri Yuda; n'ahabw'ekyo omwanya ogwo baagweta Mahane-Daani n'okuhitsya hati; guri enyima ya Kiryasi-yearimu. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Baarugayo, baahika omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu aha nju ya Miika. <verse eid="JDG 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 8:27">Bar 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 17:5">17:5</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikireyo, abo bashaija bataano abaabaire nibaza kutata ensi ya Laishi, baagira beene waabo bati: Nimumanya ku omuri aga maju harimu efodi na terafimu n'ekishushani kiheesire, kandi ekisharwire? N'ahabw'ekyo muteekateekye eki muraakore. <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Baakiikama, baataaha omu nju y'ogwo mutsigazi Omuleevi omu ka ya Miika, baamubuuza oku araire; <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />kandi abo bashaija magana mukaaga ab'omu ruganda rwa Daani baayemerera aha irembo, bakwaitse eby'okurwanisa byabo; <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:19">Kut 31:19</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 31:30">30</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima abo bashaija bataano abaagiire kutata ensi, baazayo, baataahamu, baihamu ekyo kishushani kiheesire kandi ekisharwire, na efodi na terafimu; omunyamurwa yaayemerera omu irembo hamwe n'abo bashaija magana mukaaga abakwaitse eby'okurwanisa. <verse eid="JDG 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Abashaija bari ku baataahire omu nju ya Miika, baihamu ekishushani kiheesire kandi ekisharwire, na efodi na terafimu, omunyamurwa yaababuuza ati: Nimukora ki? <verse eid="JDG 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 29:9">Yob 29:9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 45:8">Kut 45:8</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 17:10">Bar 17:10</ref>. </char></note> Baamugarukamu bati: Hurikiza, igara akanwa; gyenda naitwe otubeere omuzaire kandi omunyamurwa. Ekirikukukirira oburungi n'okuba omunyamurwa w'eka y'omuntu omwe, nari okuba omunyamurwa w'oruganda n'omuryango omuri Israeli? <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Omunyamurwa yaashemererwa munonga omu mutima, yaatwara efodi na terafimu n'ekyo kishushani kisharwire, yaagyenda n'abo bashaija bamushagatiire.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Batyo baakiikama, baagyenda beebembeize abaana n'amatungo n'ebintu. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Ku baabaire baagyendaho akaanya okuruga aha ka ya Miika, abantu abaabaire bari omu maju agari haihi n'eka ya Miika baayeteerana, baakurata Abadaani, baabahika haihi. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Baabeeta nibabakabukira. Abadaani baahinduka, baabuuza Miika bati: Obaire ota okutuhururira n'omutwe ogurikwingana gutyo? <verse eid="JDG 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Miika yaabagarukamu ati: Mwanyaga baaruhanga bangye abu naakozire, n'omunyamurwa wangye, mwayegyendera; kandi ekindi naatsigarana ki? Mbwenu nimumbuuriza ki ngu, Obaire ota? <verse eid="JDG 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:8">2 Sam 17:8</ref>. </char></note> Abadaani baamugira bati: Tutagaruka kukuhurira, abanyakiniga batakaakugwaho, bakakwita n'ab'omu ka yaawe. <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Abadaani baayegyendera; Miika ku yaareebire bamukiza amaani, yaakuba yaagaruka owe.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:22">Bir 33:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 19:47">Yos 19:47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baatwara ebi Miika yaabaire akozire, n'omunyamurwa ou yaabaire aine, baaza Laishi, baahika omu bantu bari abatuurize, abataine ki beetaireho; baabaitsa rurara, baayotsya orurembo rwabo. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Abo bantu baabura kijuna, ahabw'okuba orurembo rwabo rukaba ruri hare na Sidoni, kandi bakaba batarikukwatanisa n'abandi; kandi orurembo rwabo ruri omu ruhanga oruri haihi na Besirehobu. Bwanyima Abadaani baayombekayo orundi rurembo, baarutuuramu. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Orwo rurembo baarweta Daani, nibarweterera ishenkurubo Daani, owaazairwe Israeli; kwonka eiziina ry'orwo rurembo ery'okubanza rikaba riri Laishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Abadaani baayeteeraho ekyo kishushani; kandi Yonasaani mwene Gereshoni, mutabani wa Musa, we n'abatabani baaguma bari abanyamurwa b'oruganda rwa Daani okuhitsya aha izooba eri ensi yaanyagiirweho. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Batyo baataho ekyo kishushani kisharwire, eki Miika yaakozire, kyagumaho ebiro byona ebi enju ya Ruhanga yaamazire omuri Shiilo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'Omuleevi n'omukazi we w'ekinyanshunju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 17:6">Bar 17:6</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 17:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebi Abaisraeli baabaire bataine mugabe, hakaba hariho Omuleevi owaabaire ashuhuukiire enyima y'ensi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu; yaashwera omukazi w'ekinyanshunju, ou yaihire omuri Betelehemu-yuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Omukazi we yaamugwerwa kubi, yaayangana, yaagaruka owa ishe omuri Betelehemu-yuda, yaamarayo ameezi ana. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Bwanyima iba yaimuka, yaamukurata yaaza kumweshengyereza kumugarura, yaagyenda n'omugaragwa we n'endogoya ibiri; omukazi yaamutaasya omu ka ya ishe; ishezaara ku yaamureebire, yaija kumubugana ashemereirwe. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Ishezaara, ishe w'ogwo mwishiki, yaamwosesa, yaamara nawe ebiro bishatu; baarya, baanywa, baaguma aho. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Aha kiro kya kana baimuka omu kasheeshe kare, ogwo Muleevi yaimuka kurugayo; ishe w'omwishiki yaagambira omukwe ati: Banza orye akagaati, ogarukwemu amaani, bwanyima obone kugyenda. <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Batyo baashutama bombi hamwe, baarya, baanywa; bwanyima ishe w'omwishiki yaagambira omukwe ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ikiriza ogarukye oraare, omutima gwawe gushemererwe. <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Ogwo mushaija ku yaimukire kugyenda, ishezaara yaamweshengyereza, okuhitsya obu yaagarukire akaraarayo. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Aha izooba rya kataano yaimuka omu kasheeshe kare kugyenda; ishe w'omwishiki yaagira ati: Huumuza omutima, ninkweshengyereza, osiibe aha okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. Batyo baarya hamwe. <verse eid="JDG 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Omushaija ku yaimukire kugyenda, we n'omukazi we n'omugaragwa we, ishezaara, ishe w'ogwo mwishiki, yaamugira ati: Reeba, eizooba ryahendekire, nimbeeshengyereza mugarukye muraare; reeba, bwaizire, raara, omutima gwawe gushemererwe; nyencakare mugurukye kare, mutaahe.<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Kwonka omushaija tiyaikiriza kuraara, yaimuka, yaagyenda, yaahika ahashungaine na Yebusi, niyo Yerusaalemu; obwo aine endogoya ibiri eziriho amatandiiko, kandi aine n'omukazi we. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:21">Bar 1:21</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikire haihi na Yebusi, bwashangwa buri haihi kwira; omugaragwa yaagira mukama we ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ija tukiikame, turaare omuri oru rurembo rw'Abayebusi. <verse eid="JDG 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:26">1 Sam 10:26</ref>. </char></note> Mukama we yaamugira ati: Titurikwija kukiikama omu rurembo rw'abanyamahanga, orutari rw'Abaisraeli, kureka twambukye tuhikye Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Yaagaruka yaagambira omugaragwa we ati: Ija tuhikye haihi na Gibea nari Raama, turaare omu rurembo rumwe ahari ezo. <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Batyo baayogaho, baagyenda; ku baahikire haihi na Gibea eya Benyamiini, eizooba ryarenga. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:43">Mat 25:43</ref>. </char></note> Baakiikamira aho, baaza Gibea kuraarayo. Ku yaahikireyo, yaashutama ahu emihanda y'omu rurembo erikuteeranira, ahakuba tiharabaireho owaikiriize kubaraaza.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Bwanyima omuri ogwo mwabazyo haija omugurusi naaruga omu musiri ei yaabaire naakora; omugurusi ogwo akaba ari ow'omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, owaabaire ashuhuukiire Gibea; kwonka ab'omuri orwo rurembo bakaba bari Ababenyamiini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba omugyenzi omu nguuto y'orwo rurembo. Ogwo mugurusi yaamubuuza ati: Nooruga hi, kandi nooza hi? <verse eid="JDG 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Nituruga Betelehemu-yuda, nituza enyima y'ensi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu; niyo naarugire, ninza Betelehemu-yuda; mbwenu ninza omu nju ya MUKAMA, ahakuba tihariho owaikiriza kundaaza. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Kwonka twine embuba n'eby'okurya by'endogoya zaitu; kandi twine omugaati na viinyo ahabwangye n'omuzaana waawe n'omutsigazi ou twine; titwine ki turikwetenga. <verse eid="JDG 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:2">Kut 19:2</ref>. </char></note> Omugurusi yaagira ati: Huumura! Niinyija kukukorera ebi orikwetenga byona; kwonka otaraara omu muhanda. <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:32">Kut 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:44">Luk 7:44</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaabataasya omu ka ye, yaaha endogoya z'ogwo mushaija eby'okurya, baanaaba ebigyere, baarya, baanywa.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 19:4-8">Kut 19:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:9">Hos 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:12">1 Sam 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:26">Rom 1:26</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 1:27">27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibakishemererwa, haija abantu b'abanyarurembo abataine mugasho, baayehinguririza egyo nju, baateera orwigi, baagambira ogwo mugurusi nyineeka, bati: Shohoza ogwo mushaija owaija omu nju yaawe, tumumanye. <verse eid="JDG 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Omushaija nyineeka yaashohora ahu baabaire bari, yaabagira ati: Beene waitu, murekye, naabeeshengyereza, mutakora ekibi ekirikwingana kityo; ogu mushaija yaataahire omu nju yangye, mutakora ekihagaro ekirikushusha kityo. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Reeba, hariho muhara wangye empangare, n'omukazi w'ogu mushaija; ka mbe nibo naashohoza hati, mubashiishe, mubagire nk'oku murikwenda; kwonka omushaija ogu mutamukoraho ekihagaro ekirikushusha kityo. <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5">Kut 6:5</ref>. </char></note> Abo bashaija baayanga kumuhurira; ogwo mushaija omugyenyi nikwo kukwata omukazi we w'ekinyanshunju, akamushohoza ahu bari, bakamumanya, bakamushiisha ekiro kyona okuhitsya omu kasheeshe; ku bwabaire nibutaagurikana, baamurekura. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Omukazi yaija nibusheesha, yaagwa aha rwigi rw'enju y'ogwo mushaija, omu mukama we yaabaire ari, okuhitsya obu bwaseesire. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Mukama we ku yaimukire omu kasheeshe, yaigura enyigi z'enju, naashohora kugyenda, yaashanga ogwo mukazi we w'ekinyanshunju agwire ahansi, engaro ze ziri omu kisasi. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:5">Bar 20:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Imuka tugyende. Akateezo kaabura; bwanyima omushaija yaamuta aha ndogoya, yaimuka, yaaza owaabo. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:7">1 Sam 11:7</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaataahire omu nju ye, yaihayo omusyo, yaakwata omutumbi gw'omukazi we, yaagutemaatemera omu ngingo, yaagucwamu ebicweka ikumi na bibiri, yaabyohereza omu mashaza goona aga Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:7">Bar 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 11:14">Enf 11:14</ref>. </char></note> Abaakireebire boona baagira bati: Ekintu nk'eki tikikakorwaga, kandi tikikareebwaga, okwiha obu Abaisraeli baaruga omu nsi ya Misri n'okuhitsya hati. Mukiteekateekyeho, mukihanuureho, kandi mukigambeho.<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okuhoorera Omuleevi n'omukazi we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 13:12-16">Bir 13:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:12">Yos 22:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abaisraeli boona baaruga omu ndembo zaabo, baateeranira hamwe baine enaama emwe, okuruga ahari Daani okuhika Beeri-sheba, hamwe n'ab'ensi ya Gileadi, baateeranira Mizipa omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Abategyeki b'eihanga ryona ery'enganda za Israeli zoona, baayeyoreka omu mutwe gw'abantu ba Ruhanga, abashaija enkwata-rurara obusiriira buna abarikugyendesa ebigyere. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />(Kandi Ababenyamiini bakaba bahuriire ku Abaisraeli bainamukire Mizipa.) Abaisraeli baabuuza bati: Tugambire, ekibi ekyo kikakorwa kita? <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Ogwo Muleevi, iba w'omukazi owaitsirwe, yaagarukamu naagira ati: Nyowe nkaija Gibea eya Benyamiini n'omukazi wangye w'ekinyanshunju kuraarayo. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:22-26">Bar 19:22-26</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija ba Gibea bantaahirira, bankubira omu nju nyekiro; nyowe baayenda kuunyita, n'omukazi wangye baamuhamba n'amaani, yaafa. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:29">Bar 19:29</ref>. </char></note> Naakwata omukazi wangye, naamucwamu ebicweka, naabyohereza omu mashaza goona ag'obuhunguzi bwa Israeli; ahabw'okuba bakakora ekibi ky'obushambani, kandi ekihagaro omuri Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kur 19:5</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 19:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 19:30">Bar 19:30</ref>. </char></note> Imwe Abaisraeli mwena, mureebe, mukihanuureho, mugambire aha ekishemereire kukorwa.<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Abantu boona baimuka nk'omuntu omwe, nibagira bati: Tihaine n'omwe omuriitwe oraaze omu ihema rye, nari oraagarukye omu ka ye. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Kureka hati oku nikwo turaagire Gibea; nitwija kugiteera, twaheza kuteera enteenyu. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Kandi nitwija kutoorana abashaija ikumi omu bantu igana, na igana omu bantu rukumi, na rukumi omu bantu kakumi, nitubaiha omu nganda zoona eza Israeli, b'okuza kureetera engabo entanda, ezo ngabo ku ziraahikye Gibea eya Benyamiini, zibone kubakora nk'ebihagaro byona ebi baakozire omuri Israeli oku biri. <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Batyo Abaisraeli boona baateeranira hamwe, baine enaama emwe, kurwanisa orwo rurembo.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 22:13">Yos 22:13</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 22:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:15-18">Mat 18:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:18">Rom 12:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ab'enganda za Israeli baatuma entumwa omu ruganda rwona orwa Benyamiini, nizigira ziti: Eki ni kibi ki ekikozirwe omuriimwe? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:22">1 Sam 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:1">2 Sam 20:1</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 23:6">23:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:12">Bir 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 5:13">1 Kor 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:32">Rom 1:32</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nu mutuhe abo bashaija ba Gibea abataine mugasho, tubaite, twihe ekibi omuri Israeli. Kwonka Ababenyamiini baayanga kuhurira Abaisraeli beene waabo. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Ababenyamiini baaruga omu ndembo zaabo, baateeranira Gibea kurwanisa Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Eryo izooba baabara Ababenyamiini abarugire omu ndembo zaabo, abashaija enkwata-rurara obukumi bubiri n'enkumi mukaaga, otabariiremu ab'omuri Gibea, abashaija b'entoore magana mushanju. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:2">1 Bus 12:2</ref>. </char></note> Omuri abo bantu boona hakaba harimu abashaija b'entoore magana mushanju abarikutwara emosho; buri muntu omuribo akaba abaasa kurekyeza enjungu y'eibaare, n'akashokye akateera, atahembye. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />N'Abaisraeli abaabazirwe, otabariiremu Ababenyamiini, bakaba bari obusiriira buna enkwata-rurara; kandi abo boona bakaba bari abarwani.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 28:30">Kur 28:30</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kub 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 23:9">1 Sam 23:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 8:21">Ezr 8:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli baimuka, baaza Beseeli, baabuuza Ruhanga obwengye, nibagira bati: Nibaahi omuriitwe abaraabanze kurwanisa Ababenyamiini? MUKAMA yaagarukamu ati: Abayuda nibo baraabanzeyo. <verse eid="JDG 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Abaisraeli baimuka omu kasheeshe, baateera orusiisira kurwanisa Gibea; <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />baahurura kuteera Ababenyamiini, baatenga orugamba kurwanira nabo Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:27">Kut 49:27</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:11">Mub 9:11</ref>. </char></note> Ababenyamiini baashohora, baita Abaisraeli, baabaraza nk'ebiti, haafa abantu obukumi bubiri n'enkumi ibiri. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Kwonka Abaisraeli baayezirika, baagaruka baatenga orugamba omu mwanya ogu baarutengyeiremu okubanza. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:34-36">Zab 78:34-36</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 5:15">Hos 5:15</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli bainamuka, baaririra omu maisho ga MUKAMA okuhitsya omu mwabazyo, baabuuza MUKAMA bati: Tugarukye turwane n'Ababenyamiini beene waitu? MUKAMA yaagarukamu ati: Nimwirooko mubateere.<verse eid="JDG 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Batyo Abaisraeli bairirira Ababenyamiini kubarwanisa aha izooba rya kabiri. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:12">Yob 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 66:18">Zab 66:18</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:9">Hos 10:9</ref>. </char></note> Aha izooba eryo Ababenyamiini baaruga omuri Gibea, baabarwanisa, baagaruka baababingira kimwe, baabaitamu abantu kakumi n'enkumi munaana; kandi abo boona bakaba bari abashaija enkwata-rurara. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Bwanyima Abaisraeli boona, engabo zoona, bainamuka, baaza Beseeli, baashutama omu maisho ga MUKAMA, baarira; eryo izooba baayesiibyakwo okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; baahonga ebitambo by'okwotsya n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:6">Enf 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:3">1 Sam 4:3</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 4:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baabuuza MUKAMA, (ahakuba omuri ebyo biro eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA niyo yaabaire eri; <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:25">Kur 6:25</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 25:7">Kub 25:7</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 25:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:6">31:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:13">Yos 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:30">Zab 106:30</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:31">31</ref>. </char></note> na Finehaasi mwene Eleazaari, mutabani wa Arooni niwe yaabaire aheereza MUKAMA omu maisho gaayo) nibagira bati: Tugarukye turwane n'Ababenyamiini beene waitu, nari turereere? MUKAMA yaagarukamu ati: Nimwirooko; ahakuba nyencakare niinyija kubahayo omu mikono yaanyu.<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 8:4">Yos 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:23">2 Sam 5:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli baataho ab'okugwera aha mbaju zoona eza Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Aha izooba rya kashatu Abaisraeli baahurura kuteera Ababenyamiini, baatenga orugamba kurwanira nabo Gibea, nk'oku babaire baarwaine nabo obundi. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Ababenyamiini baashohora kubarwanisa, baabeihwabeihwa, baaruga omu rurembo; baatandika kuteera Abaisraeli n'okubaita nk'oku babaire baakozire obundi; baabaitira omu muhanda ogurikuza Beseeli n'ogurikuza Geeba, n'omu bwerere; baabaitamu abantu nka makumi ashatu. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Ababenyamiini baagira bati: Twababinga nk'okubanza. Kwonka Abaisraeli baagira bati: Ka tuhungye, tubabeihabeihe, tubaihe omu rurembo tubahitsye omu mihanda. <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Abaisraeli boona baimuka omu mwanya ogu babaire barimu, baatenga orugamba Baali-tamari; kandi abaabaire bagwereire baajumbutuka omu mwanya ogu babaire barimu Maaregeeba. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:14">Yos 8:14</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 8:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 8:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 8:11">Mub 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:11">Isa 47:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:34">Luk 21:34</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:3">1 Tes 5:3</ref>. </char></note> Omu Baisraeli boona haarugamu abashaija entoore kakumi, baateera Gibea; orugamba rwahama; kwonka aba Gibea bakaba batamanyire ku bari omu kabi. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />MUKAMA yaasingura Ababenyamiini omu maisho g'Abaisraeli; eryo izooba Abaisraeli baacwekyereza omu Babenyamiini abantu obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano na igana; kandi abo boona bakaba bari abashaija enkwata-rurara.<verse eid="JDG 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Ababenyamiini baareeba Abaisraeli ku baabingwa, ahabw'okuba Abaisraeli bakabahunga ahabw'okwesiga abagwereire abu bataire haihi na Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Abaabaire bagwereire baajumbutuka, baayetuura omuri Gibea, baacwekyereza orurembo rwona na rurara. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Kandi Abaisraeli boona bakaba baragaine akamanyiso n'abaabaire bagwereire, ngu ku baraacumbuutsye omwika mwingi nk'ekicu omu rurembo, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Abaisraeli bakubuukye, barwane. Obwo Ababenyamiini bakaba batandikire kubinga Abaisraeli n'okubaitamu abantu nka makumi ashatu; ahakuba bakagira bati: Buzimazima twababingira kimwe nk'okubanza. <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Kwonka omwika ogurikushusha nk'enyomyo ku gwatandikire kucumbuuka omu rurembo, Ababenyamiini baareeba enyima, baashanga orurembo rwona nirucumbuuka omwika okuhika ahaiguru. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:9">Kur 15:9</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 15:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baabahindukana, Ababenyamiini baashoberwa, ahakuba bakareeba akabi kaabahikaho. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />N'ahabw'ekyo baateera Abaisraeli amabega, baahunga nibatoora omu ihamba; kwonka engabo z'Abaisraeli zaabakurata zibahambize, kandi ezaarugire omu ndembo zaabatanga omu maisho, zaabacwekyereza. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:9">Hos 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:9">10:9</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baatangatanga Ababenyamiini embaju zoona, baababinga, baabaribatiirira okuruga ahari Noha, okuhika ahashungaine na Geeba oburugwa-izooba. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Omu Babenyamiini haafamu abantu kakumi n'enkumi munaana, boona abaabaire bari amamanzi. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Abaatsigaireho baahinduka, baahungira omu ihamba okuhika aha rukiri rwa Rimona; bakiri omu muhanda Abaisraeli baabaitamu abantu enkumi itaano; baagumizamu bababingire okuhika Gidomu, baitirayo abandi enkumi ibiri. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />N'ahabw'ekyo boona abaafiire omu Babenyamiini eryo izooba baahika obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano, abashaija enkwata-rurara kandi amamanzi. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 21:13">Bar 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:32">Tonz 3:32</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 3:2">Hab 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abashaija magana mukaaga baahinduka, baahungira omu ihamba, baahika aha rukiri rwa Rimona, baagumayo okumara ameezi ana. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Abaisraeli baagaruka baahindukana Ababenyamiini, baacwekyereza orurembo rwona na rurara, abantu n'amatungo n'ebi baashangiremu byona; kandi n'endembo zoona ezi baahikiremu baazootsya n'omuriro.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okusherurira abaahonokire aha icumu abakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Kandi Abaisraeli bakaba barahiriire Mizipa bati: Tihariho muntu weena omuriitwe orihingira omu Babenyamiini muhara we. <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:18">Bar 20:18</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 20:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Abantu baagaruka Beseeli, baaguma bashutami omu maisho ga Ruhanga okuhitsya omu mwabazyo, baarira nibaborooga munonga. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Baagira bati: Ai bambe MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, eki kibeereireho ki, oruganda rumwe hati okubura omuri Israeli? <verse eid="JDG 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 8:20">Kut 8:20</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:7">12:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:24">Kur 20:24</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:26">Bar 6:26</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 14:35">1 Sam 14:35</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:64">1 Bag 8:64</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:10">Heb 13:10</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwaseesire, abantu baimuka kare, baayombekayo eitambiro, baahonga ebitambo by'okwotsya n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:23">Bar 5:23</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 11:7">1 Sam 11:7</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baabuuza bati: Omu nganda za Israeli otaizire mu iteeraniro ahari MUKAMA n'oha? Ahakuba bakaba barahiire endahiro ehamire aha muntu weena oriba ataizire Mizipa ahari MUKAMA, nibagira bati: Buzimazima aryaitwa. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Abaisraeli baayefuuza ahabw'Ababenyamiini beene waabo, nibagira bati: Eri izooba hariho oruganda orucwirwe omuri Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Mbwenu tugire tuta okusherurira abaahonokireho abakazi, ku turaabe twarahiire ngu tituribahingira bahara baitu?<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 11:1">1 Sam 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 31:11">31:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 2:5">2 Sam 2:5</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 2:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baagaruka baabuuza bati: Ni ruganda ki omu nganda za Israeli orutainamukire Mizipa ahari MUKAMA? Ku baagiire kwetegyereza, baashanga hataine n'omwe orugire Yabeshi-gileadi okwija omu rusiisira ahu bateeraniire; <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />ahabw'okuba ku baabazire abantu, baashanga omu bantu ba Yabeshi-gileadi hatariho n'omwe. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:15">Bir 13:15</ref>. </char></note> Eiteeraniro ryona ryatumayo abashaija amamanzi, abarikukira abandi boona, kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, baabaragiira bati: Mugyende mucwekyereze aba Yabeshi-gileadi na rurara, n'abakazi baabo n'abaana baabo. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:17">Kub 31:17</ref>. </char></note> Eki mube nikyo mwakora; mucwekyerereze kimwe abashaija boona na buri mukazi weena oraraire n'omushaija. <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Omu ba Yabeshi-gileadi baashangayo abaishiki magana ana, abaabaire batakamanyaga bashaija; baabareeta omu rusiisira orwabaire ruri Shiilo omu nsi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 20:47">Bar 20:47</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 20:10">Bir 20:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eihanga ryona ryatuma aha Babenyamiini, abaabaire bari omu rukiri rwa Rimona, baabahuumuriza. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Ababenyamiini baagaruka obwo; baabaha abo baishiki abu baakirize omu ba Yabeshi-gileadi; kwonka tibaabahika. <verse eid="JDG 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Abantu baagaruka baayefuuza ahabw'Ababenyamiini, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akaba areetsire ekyasha omuri Israeli.<verse eid="JDG 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Bwanyima abakuru b'eihanga baagira bati: Mbwenu tugire tuta okusherurira abatsigaireho abakazi, abakazi ku baraabe bahweireho omuri Benyamiini? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Baagira bati: Ababenyamiini abahonokire aha icumu bashemereire kugira ab'okubahungurira, harekye kugira oruganda orwahwaho muri Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:35">Bar 11:35</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka titurikubaasa kubahingira bahara baitu, ahabw'okuba Abaisraeli bakaba barahiire bati: Omuntu weena orihingira muhara we omu Babenyamiini akyenwe. <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Baagaruka baagira bati: Nimumanya ku habaho obugyenyi bwa MUKAMA buri mwaka omuri Shiilo, eri aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho bwa Beseeli aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba bw'omuhanda ogurikuruga Beseeli nigwinamuka Shekemu, kandi aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo bwa Lebona. <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Baaragiira Ababenyamiini bati: Mwirooko muze omu misiri y'emizaabibu, <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:34">Bar 11:34</ref>. </char></note> mugume mugwereire; abaishiki ba Shiilo ku baraabe nibaza kuzina, mugurukye omu misiri y'emizaabibu, buri muntu ayekwatire omukazi omuri abo baishiki ba Shiilo; bwanyima mugarukye omu nsi ya Benyamiini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Baishebo nari banyaanyabo ku baraije kututonganaho, nitwija kubagira tuti: Mubatuhe ahabw'embabazi, ahabw'okuba buri muntu tituramunyagiire mukazi omu rugamba; kandi naimwe timurababahaire; kuri niimwe mwababahaire, mukaagizire orubanja. <verse eid="JDG 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:48">Bar 20:48</ref>. </char></note> Ababenyamiini baakora batyo; baayekwatira abakazi omuri abo abaabaire nibaza kuzina, nk'oku abashaija baabaire nibaingana, baabatwara; bwanyima baagyenda, baagaruka omu buhunguzi bwabo, baayombeka endembo ezaabaire zisheenyirwe, baazituuramu. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Kandi Abaisraeli baarugayo omu bunaku obwo, buri muntu yaagaruka omu ruganda rwe n'omuri beene waabo. Okuruga aho buri muntu yaaza omu buhunguzi bwe. <verse eid="JDG 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 17:6">Bar 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 18:1">18:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 19:1">19:1</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:3-5">Rom 13:3-5</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo hakaba hatariho mugabe omuri Israeli; kureka buri muntu akaba naayekorera nk'oku arikwenda.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>